(4240594, 611851, 27514, '<td valign="top">very nice, love the effect it has on it. the eyes are very captivation and the expression really is great. I wish the crop would take more off of the left though. other then that a very good image.<br/> <br/>8</td>', 'very nice, love the effect it has on it. the eyes are very captivation and the expression really is great. I wish the crop would take more off of the left though. other then that a very good image. 8', '2007-11-12 09:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
