(4240598, 611389, 27514, '<td valign="top">you have a great image here, but it''s being distracted by whatever you were shooting through. did you ever think of croping out all of that and only keeping what is betwen the bar. much stronger image there</td>', 'you have a great image here, but it''s being distracted by whatever you were shooting through. did you ever think of croping out all of that and only keeping what is betwen the bar. much stronger image there', '2007-11-12 09:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4240599, 611577, 53147, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. I do wish the crop was a bit wider to allow his chest fur all the way in the shot and his tail to be fully seen. But overall an excellent image. Great eye detail, good timing on catching his meow and the color tones work well. Very cool image. Bumping up.</td>', 'I really like this shot. I do wish the crop was a bit wider to allow his chest fur all the way in the shot and his tail to be fully seen. But overall an excellent image. Great eye detail, good timing on catching his meow and the color tones work well. Very cool image. Bumping up.', '2007-11-12 09:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4240600, 611120, 27514, '<td valign="top">there seems to be a focus issue and the highlights are dark and muddy. if you use levels you can fix that</td>', 'there seems to be a focus issue and the highlights are dark and muddy. if you use levels you can fix that', '2007-11-12 09:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
