(4240656, 610923, 53147, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Wonderful detail, square centered crop is perfect and her gaze is almost hypnotizing. I hope this scores well. Bumping up to 9 for now.<br/> <br/>Back one more time - I think I see a tiny little photographer in the eyes of that little Afghani girl. Could be mistaken though - but I dont think so. ;)</td>', 'Very nice. Wonderful detail, square centered crop is perfect and her gaze is almost hypnotizing. I hope this scores well. Bumping up to 9 for now. Back one more time - I think I see a tiny little photographer in the eyes of that little Afghani girl. Could be mistaken though - but I dont think so. ;)', '2007-11-12 09:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
