(4241412, 610882, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like the picture very much.  The square format makes it look rather curious: it''s such an "active" picture, with the waves, the big of fog rolling in, yet it is so "contained" in a square with the tree right smack in the middle.  My one BIG nitpick is the loss of detail in the waves (looks like overly noise-ninjaed or similar).</td>', 'I like the picture very much.  The square format makes it look rather curious: it''s such an "active" picture, with the waves, the big of fog rolling in, yet it is so "contained" in a square with the tree right smack in the middle.  My one BIG nitpick is the loss of detail in the waves (looks like overly noise-ninjaed or similar).', '2007-11-12 14:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
