(4242703, 612223, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.  I wish you''d trimmed off just a little off the top, to eliminate the white area there.  I think the image would look more put together without that.  I also wish there were a bit more detail in the bottom of body area.  Otherwise, quite beautiful.  I like the out of focus background, it looks great here.</td>', 'Nice picture.  I wish you''d trimmed off just a little off the top, to eliminate the white area there.  I think the image would look more put together without that.  I also wish there were a bit more detail in the bottom of body area.  Otherwise, quite beautiful.  I like the out of focus background, it looks great here.', '2007-11-12 23:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
