(4242727, 612245, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful details.  I don''t know if it would work in this case, but I wonder if using a polarizer would eliminate some of the glary reflections on the leather.</td>', 'Beautiful details.  I don''t know if it would work in this case, but I wonder if using a polarizer would eliminate some of the glary reflections on the leather.', '2007-11-12 23:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
