(4242732, 612278, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good idea, to make an image right from on top of a compact fluorescent.  On my monitor, it looks slightly soft.  I think it needs something else to "sell" the image (at DPC or elsewhere).  It''s neat, but by itself it''s sort of bland.</td>', 'Good idea, to make an image right from on top of a compact fluorescent.  On my monitor, it looks slightly soft.  I think it needs something else to "sell" the image (at DPC or elsewhere).  It''s neat, but by itself it''s sort of bland.', '2007-11-12 23:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4242737, 611476, 5112, '<td valign="top">Morning light is beautiful, and I can imagine that you might have enjoyed the light this particular morning.  However, as an image, it doesn''t really tell me much about the beauty of the morning light.  I sort of wonder if in this case going further back for more context (I guess it depends on the context) would help.</td>', 'Morning light is beautiful, and I can imagine that you might have enjoyed the light this particular morning.  However, as an image, it doesn''t really tell me much about the beauty of the morning light.  I sort of wonder if in this case going further back for more context (I guess it depends on the context) would help.', '2007-11-12 23:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4242741, 611725, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good looking subject, interesting expression.  The image looks slightly "muddy", as if maybe it could use a bit more contrast or something like that, especially maybe the beard area.</td>', 'Good looking subject, interesting expression.  The image looks slightly "muddy", as if maybe it could use a bit more contrast or something like that, especially maybe the beard area.', '2007-11-12 23:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4242747, 612285, 5112, '<td valign="top">This looks a lot like where I live in a way.  It''s great that you have these beautiful sheep around to photograph.  The picture itself, well, I wish the two rear-ends were not right in front, it sort of detracts from the image.  The intruding sheep at the right also.  I wonder if it would be possible for you to get closer and isolate a smaller area, maybe just one or two sheep, and concentrate on their beautiful faces/horns.</td>', 'This looks a lot like where I live in a way.  It''s great that you have these beautiful sheep around to photograph.  The picture itself, well, I wish the two rear-ends were not right in front, it sort of detracts from the image.  The intruding sheep at the right also.  I wonder if it would be possible for you to get closer and isolate a smaller area, maybe just one or two sheep, and concentrate on their beautiful faces/horns.', '2007-11-12 23:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4242751, 611801, 5112, '<td valign="top">The light is a bit harsh on the Veteran''s face.  Otherwise, a beautiful image.</td>', 'The light is a bit harsh on the Veteran''s face.  Otherwise, a beautiful image.', '2007-11-12 23:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4242757, 609641, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice stop action and movement image at the same time.  It looks like you overdid it on the NN (or noise removal of some sort).  I wish the two people in the background were either as sharp as the girl''s face, or a fair bit more out of focus - as it is, they''re "almost" sharp, and that''s distracting.  The image also looks like a straight B/W (no other tone).</td>', 'Nice stop action and movement image at the same time.  It looks like you overdid it on the NN (or noise removal of some sort).  I wish the two people in the background were either as sharp as the girl''s face, or a fair bit more out of focus - as it is, they''re "almost" sharp, and that''s distracting.  The image also looks like a straight B/W (no other tone).', '2007-11-12 23:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4242761, 610411, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, except I wish that branch going across horizontally were not there.    You maybe could have taken away that little branch, and moved slightly to the right, to line up a bit more of the main subject into the image and still include the two out of focus stalks and the beautiful background.</td>', 'Beautiful, except I wish that branch going across horizontally were not there.    You maybe could have taken away that little branch, and moved slightly to the right, to line up a bit more of the main subject into the image and still include the two out of focus stalks and the beautiful background.', '2007-11-12 23:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4242764, 611463, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, really quite beautiful.  However, it is not a duotone.  ~5</td>', 'Beautiful, really quite beautiful.  However, it is not a duotone.  ~5', '2007-11-12 23:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4242777, 611403, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail, I quite like this image.  It looks B/W, not duotone (maybe the "duotone" part is very subtle :)</td>', 'Beautiful detail, I quite like this image.  It looks B/W, not duotone (maybe the "duotone" part is very subtle :)', '2007-11-12 23:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4242782, 611481, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful place, I love the shininess of the water/boats.</td>', 'Beautiful place, I love the shininess of the water/boats.', '2007-11-12 23:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4242784, 612284, 5112, '<td valign="top">Freedumb, eh?  Funny.</td>', 'Freedumb, eh?  Funny.', '2007-11-12 23:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4242791, 610208, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice action, but maybe a bit too close, or too low?  As it is, the rather large patch of hillside/grass at the bottom left doesn''t really add to the image, but the antlers are cut off.  The light looks slightly harsh also, especially on the grass and horns.  I don''t know if you used a polarizer, but if not, it might help to use one in situations like this.</td>', 'Nice action, but maybe a bit too close, or too low?  As it is, the rather large patch of hillside/grass at the bottom left doesn''t really add to the image, but the antlers are cut off.  The light looks slightly harsh also, especially on the grass and horns.  I don''t know if you used a polarizer, but if not, it might help to use one in situations like this.', '2007-11-12 23:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4242794, 611752, 5112, '<td valign="top">Looks like an inversion.  Curious concept, but I''m not sure it works here, and I also am not sure if this is a duotone or not.</td>', 'Looks like an inversion.  Curious concept, but I''m not sure it works here, and I also am not sure if this is a duotone or not.', '2007-11-12 23:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4242809, 611764, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful symetry.  The light shining in is a tad overpowering.</td>', 'Beautiful symetry.  The light shining in is a tad overpowering.', '2007-11-12 23:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4242813, 609675, 5112, '<td valign="top">Quite beautiful.  I particularily like the sky, the blues that look almost black in this view.  Maybe just a tad too much foreground.</td>', 'Quite beautiful.  I particularily like the sky, the blues that look almost black in this view.  Maybe just a tad too much foreground.', '2007-11-12 23:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4242817, 611771, 30214, '<td valign="top">hey I know this photo! :) it''s still very good, but it is one of those (relatively rare) cases when I think it is better left in color. In the color version the contrast between the blackened sculpture and the surrounding is much more stark. JMO, of course.</td>', 'hey I know this photo! :) it''s still very good, but it is one of those (relatively rare) cases when I think it is better left in color. In the color version the contrast between the blackened sculpture and the surrounding is much more stark. JMO, of course.', '2007-11-12 23:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
