(4242940, 610859, 28882, '<td valign="top">the flat frontal light hurts this image imo. also the object above is not in or out of the picture enough. Cute model.</td>', 'the flat frontal light hurts this image imo. also the object above is not in or out of the picture enough. Cute model.', '2007-11-13 00:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
