(4242991, 611770, 5112, '<td valign="top">@ la Anne Geddes :)  It''s pretty good, except that to my eyes, the fabric holding the baby is just a bit too prominent, and the light maybe just a tad too bright.</td>', '@ la Anne Geddes :)  It''s pretty good, except that to my eyes, the fabric holding the baby is just a bit too prominent, and the light maybe just a tad too bright.', '2007-11-13 01:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
