(4243149, 610079, 30982, '<td valign="top">It looks like it''s trying to hide, to blend in with it''s surroundings.</td>', 'It looks like it''s trying to hide, to blend in with it''s surroundings.', '2007-11-13 05:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243151, 610877, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the lens flare in this, and the juxtaposition of solar versus manmade power.  The foreground and sky are both very similar in tone is this monochromatic presentation - a bit more separation, particularly of the poles against the sky - would give this a bit more "punch" I think.</td>', 'I like the lens flare in this, and the juxtaposition of solar versus manmade power.  The foreground and sky are both very similar in tone is this monochromatic presentation - a bit more separation, particularly of the poles against the sky - would give this a bit more "punch" I think.', '2007-11-13 05:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243152, 609873, 30982, '<td valign="top">His coloring and pattern doesn''t translate well into good detail in B&amp;W here - unfortunately for us as photographers, critters tend to blend in with their surroundings a little too well sometimes!</td>', 'His coloring and pattern doesn''t translate well into good detail in B&W here - unfortunately for us as photographers, critters tend to blend in with their surroundings a little too well sometimes!', '2007-11-13 05:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243153, 611607, 30982, '<td valign="top">Some nice rich browns in this, but I''m finding it hard to focus on a particular aspect of this shot.  (And I get that comment a lot, too, by the way.)  Maybe a closer selection, contrasting the texture of a leaf or two against that of the wood?</td>', 'Some nice rich browns in this, but I''m finding it hard to focus on a particular aspect of this shot.  (And I get that comment a lot, too, by the way.)  Maybe a closer selection, contrasting the texture of a leaf or two against that of the wood?', '2007-11-13 05:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243154, 611020, 30982, '<td valign="top">You''ve got pretty good light here, and good skin tones in the conversion.  I''m not sure about the pose, though it is attention grabbing.  She has very seductive eyes.  :-)  The backdrop wrinkles can be "smoothed" in post processing for advanced editing, either by selecting the background and applying gaussian blur, or using the blur tool in Photoshop.  It will give a more finished appearance to the shot, in my opinion.</td>', 'You''ve got pretty good light here, and good skin tones in the conversion.  I''m not sure about the pose, though it is attention grabbing.  She has very seductive eyes.  :-)  The backdrop wrinkles can be "smoothed" in post processing for advanced editing, either by selecting the background and applying gaussian blur, or using the blur tool in Photoshop.  It will give a more finished appearance to the shot, in my opinion.', '2007-11-13 05:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243155, 610417, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice catch and nice toning.  I wonder if the horn separation is an injury?</td>', 'Nice catch and nice toning.  I wonder if the horn separation is an injury?', '2007-11-13 05:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243156, 612233, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot - I can see this in the sports section of the paper.  I especially like the unbroken water in front, too.</td>', 'Nice action shot - I can see this in the sports section of the paper.  I especially like the unbroken water in front, too.', '2007-11-13 05:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243157, 611057, 30982, '<td valign="top">Technically very nice!</td>', 'Technically very nice!', '2007-11-13 05:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243181, 611646, 86587, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2007-11-13 07:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243187, 609809, 67152, '<td valign="top">excellent image - love the feel created  - back to up it to 9</td>', 'excellent image - love the feel created  - back to up it to 9', '2007-11-13 07:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243196, 611460, 63398, '<td valign="top">This is just lovely! I cannot think of a better entry, well executed and just WOW!!! 10</td>', 'This is just lovely! I cannot think of a better entry, well executed and just WOW!!! 10', '2007-11-13 07:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243199, 611558, 63398, '<td valign="top">Way cute! I have a twelve year old daughter, and I see this scene through familiar eyes. Very nice! Like the DOF and the lighting very much.</td>', 'Way cute! I have a twelve year old daughter, and I see this scene through familiar eyes. Very nice! Like the DOF and the lighting very much.', '2007-11-13 07:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243200, 611740, 63398, '<td valign="top">Like the textures, lighting, macro, and contrast. Very well done, IMO.</td>', 'Like the textures, lighting, macro, and contrast. Very well done, IMO.', '2007-11-13 07:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243203, 611595, 1024, '<td valign="top">I feel like I am peeking into a private moment.  I love this, the tones are perfect.</td>', 'I feel like I am peeking into a private moment.  I love this, the tones are perfect.', '2007-11-13 07:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243204, 610315, 1024, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous tones and composition.</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous tones and composition.', '2007-11-13 07:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243207, 611063, 1024, '<td valign="top">Just dark enough to evoke mystery.</td>', 'Just dark enough to evoke mystery.', '2007-11-13 07:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243210, 610558, 63398, '<td valign="top">I like this, but there''s something that doesn''t quite make it for me to be superlative, just very nice. I cannot help with a suggestion, though......I wouldn''t know what to do were it mine. I do like the geometric design, and the lighted opening. I''m giving it a 6.0 ''cause it is good, but I think a PS guru could make it pop, or something.</td>', 'I like this, but there''s something that doesn''t quite make it for me to be superlative, just very nice. I cannot help with a suggestion, though......I wouldn''t know what to do were it mine. I do like the geometric design, and the lighted opening. I''m giving it a 6.0 ''cause it is good, but I think a PS guru could make it pop, or something.', '2007-11-13 07:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243211, 611586, 63398, '<td valign="top">I like the way the leaves kind of appear to be suspended.....nice effect!</td>', 'I like the way the leaves kind of appear to be suspended.....nice effect!', '2007-11-13 07:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243215, 612233, 63398, '<td valign="top">Truly excellent capture!</td>', 'Truly excellent capture!', '2007-11-13 07:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243221, 610934, 63398, '<td valign="top">Terrific forboding and gloomy take on this always photographed with the blue sky/bright sun typical image. Very good!</td>', 'Terrific forboding and gloomy take on this always photographed with the blue sky/bright sun typical image. Very good!', '2007-11-13 07:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243222, 611757, 63398, '<td valign="top">Love this! I have six of these rascals and they''re darn hard to capture......especially like this! VERY nice!!!</td>', 'Love this! I have six of these rascals and they''re darn hard to capture......especially like this! VERY nice!!!', '2007-11-13 07:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243230, 611556, 63398, '<td valign="top">I like the stark white.....it gives this an intensity that makes me uncomfortable with that gaze. 7</td>', 'I like the stark white.....it gives this an intensity that makes me uncomfortable with that gaze. 7', '2007-11-13 07:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243235, 611755, 63398, '<td valign="top">The grain in this actually works for me, and that''s unusual. Terrific capture......very nicely done! 7</td>', 'The grain in this actually works for me, and that''s unusual. Terrific capture......very nicely done! 7', '2007-11-13 07:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243236, 610415, 70661, '<td valign="top">I like how you caught the boy watching.</td>', 'I like how you caught the boy watching.', '2007-11-13 07:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243246, 611735, 63398, '<td valign="top">I like the weeds as a hanging forelock and the shadows.....</td>', 'I like the weeds as a hanging forelock and the shadows.....', '2007-11-13 07:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243262, 611826, 63398, '<td valign="top">A good portrait.....the title seems kind of irrelevant, and IMO detracts from the entry. I''m voting this a 6.0 solely on its merits as a good portrait.</td>', 'A good portrait.....the title seems kind of irrelevant, and IMO detracts from the entry. I''m voting this a 6.0 solely on its merits as a good portrait.', '2007-11-13 08:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243264, 610641, 70661, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome shot! I love the way you processed it.</td>', 'This is an awesome shot! I love the way you processed it.', '2007-11-13 08:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243268, 611522, 63398, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!!! Great execution of a lovely composition. 8</td>', 'Beautiful!!! Great execution of a lovely composition. 8', '2007-11-13 08:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243270, 611501, 63398, '<td valign="top">Serene....</td>', 'Serene....', '2007-11-13 08:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243271, 610703, 63398, '<td valign="top">Nice job of producing pizzaz from what could have been an otherwise unappealing shot.</td>', 'Nice job of producing pizzaz from what could have been an otherwise unappealing shot.', '2007-11-13 08:07:05.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4243272, 611578, 63398, '<td valign="top">I really like this one a lot! Great choice of shade/color/tone/whatever! LOL!!! 8</td>', 'I really like this one a lot! Great choice of shade/color/tone/whatever! LOL!!! 8', '2007-11-13 08:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243273, 611524, 63398, '<td valign="top">What a lovely shot!</td>', 'What a lovely shot!', '2007-11-13 08:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243276, 610359, 49109, '<td valign="top">nice idea, good focus, good choice of color. child''s left shoulder looks strange because of the missing color. empty space at left does nothing for the picture</td>', 'nice idea, good focus, good choice of color. child''s left shoulder looks strange because of the missing color. empty space at left does nothing for the picture', '2007-11-13 08:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243279, 611693, 49109, '<td valign="top">good tones and color, but too much going on in the picture</td>', 'good tones and color, but too much going on in the picture', '2007-11-13 08:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243282, 610523, 63398, '<td valign="top">Really nice! Completely impossible for me to get a handle on orientation.......love the way it makes me feel off balance! Fabulous angle and perspective! 9</td>', 'Really nice! Completely impossible for me to get a handle on orientation.......love the way it makes me feel off balance! Fabulous angle and perspective! 9', '2007-11-13 08:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243285, 611465, 49109, '<td valign="top">Hmm, wonder if this is the same one a sin the popcorn challenge - after the barber''s visit. <br/>Good lighting and crop. Had taken of that awful necklace.</td>', 'Hmm, wonder if this is the same one a sin the popcorn challenge - after the barber''s visit. Good lighting and crop. Had taken of that awful necklace.', '2007-11-13 08:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243287, 611394, 49109, '<td valign="top">why have you cropped off her head?</td>', 'why have you cropped off her head?', '2007-11-13 08:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243288, 610611, 63398, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title......there''s a hot spot on the radio, yet it''s too dark on the right. The picture on the wall detracts from the arrangement, too. All this my opinion and please know I''m just trying to be honest in its impression on me. 4</td>', 'I don''t get the title......there''s a hot spot on the radio, yet it''s too dark on the right. The picture on the wall detracts from the arrangement, too. All this my opinion and please know I''m just trying to be honest in its impression on me. 4', '2007-11-13 08:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243289, 610208, 63398, '<td valign="top">Outstanding capture!</td>', 'Outstanding capture!', '2007-11-13 08:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243291, 610409, 70661, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Very interesting to look at. I like your processing too. 10</td>', 'Great shot! Very interesting to look at. I like your processing too. 10', '2007-11-13 08:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243293, 610871, 70661, '<td valign="top">Great capture! 10</td>', 'Great capture! 10', '2007-11-13 08:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243298, 611525, 63398, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect.</td>', 'Interesting effect.', '2007-11-13 08:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243303, 611835, 63398, '<td valign="top">The rice plants are too distracting for my tastes. And the blurring of the wings doesn''t help, IMO.</td>', 'The rice plants are too distracting for my tastes. And the blurring of the wings doesn''t help, IMO.', '2007-11-13 08:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243305, 611586, 30982, '<td valign="top">Well titled and looks like something I''d take to get the textures.  As a duotone, I think it would do better with more contrast - everything seems to be a similar shade/tone.</td>', 'Well titled and looks like something I''d take to get the textures.  As a duotone, I think it would do better with more contrast - everything seems to be a similar shade/tone.', '2007-11-13 08:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243306, 611771, 63398, '<td valign="top">Excellent! Great tones, texture, detail, bokeh! 8</td>', 'Excellent! Great tones, texture, detail, bokeh! 8', '2007-11-13 08:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243308, 610871, 30982, '<td valign="top">Yowza, if that''s real I''d not be out shooting!  Nice composition.</td>', 'Yowza, if that''s real I''d not be out shooting!  Nice composition.', '2007-11-13 08:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243309, 611704, 30982, '<td valign="top">I recognize this place!  I even recognize this angle of this place.  I like it done in the blues.  Square crop makes for a nice comp.  A tad oversharpened in places, which is something I find hard to avoid with straight lines.</td>', 'I recognize this place!  I even recognize this angle of this place.  I like it done in the blues.  Square crop makes for a nice comp.  A tad oversharpened in places, which is something I find hard to avoid with straight lines.', '2007-11-13 08:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243310, 609869, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the odd structures involved - the construction equipment and a skateboarder - interesting combo.  I will say it looks more like a desat than a duotone - you''ll probably get dinged for that as far as score goes.</td>', 'I like the odd structures involved - the construction equipment and a skateboarder - interesting combo.  I will say it looks more like a desat than a duotone - you''ll probably get dinged for that as far as score goes.', '2007-11-13 08:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243311, 611588, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice warmth to the tones.</td>', 'Nice warmth to the tones.', '2007-11-13 08:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243312, 609696, 30982, '<td valign="top">I do like this in B&amp;W, particularly since the dogs are those colors.  Nice composition as well.</td>', 'I do like this in B&W, particularly since the dogs are those colors.  Nice composition as well.', '2007-11-13 08:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243314, 610859, 30982, '<td valign="top">May be considered a bit of a snapshot to some voters, but her look is delightful!</td>', 'May be considered a bit of a snapshot to some voters, but her look is delightful!', '2007-11-13 08:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243317, 611806, 30982, '<td valign="top">I quite like the composition of this, with the overhanging branch filling in the sky.  I''m not as fond of the color of the toning, though.</td>', 'I quite like the composition of this, with the overhanging branch filling in the sky.  I''m not as fond of the color of the toning, though.', '2007-11-13 08:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243319, 611816, 30982, '<td valign="top">An intriguing structure!</td>', 'An intriguing structure!', '2007-11-13 08:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243320, 609350, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the sentiment - a lost treasure kinda thing.  The sepia toning suits it well, too, and the light is good to show off the texture of the leaves.  Not as fond of the centered comp, but not sure if it would be better otherwise either.</td>', 'I like the sentiment - a lost treasure kinda thing.  The sepia toning suits it well, too, and the light is good to show off the texture of the leaves.  Not as fond of the centered comp, but not sure if it would be better otherwise either.', '2007-11-13 08:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243321, 611759, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very nice informal portrait.  Very good catchlights in the eyes, and a great smile!</td>', 'A very nice informal portrait.  Very good catchlights in the eyes, and a great smile!', '2007-11-13 08:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243322, 611465, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very well done pet portrait!</td>', 'Very well done pet portrait!', '2007-11-13 08:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243326, 611341, 6999, '<td valign="top">The muddling-up of the tonality of this is just too much for me - takes it out of the realm of the photographic completely I feel: if you''re at liberty to re-organise the light in this way, what''s the point of using your camera? <br/> <br/>Beyond which, it has a certain compositional grace to it: I like the slight madness of obscuring the spire with that tree, and the balancing of that with the almost hyper-domestic seeming porchway. Subversive, and fun.</td>', 'The muddling-up of the tonality of this is just too much for me - takes it out of the realm of the photographic completely I feel: if you''re at liberty to re-organise the light in this way, what''s the point of using your camera?  Beyond which, it has a certain compositional grace to it: I like the slight madness of obscuring the spire with that tree, and the balancing of that with the almost hyper-domestic seeming porchway. Subversive, and fun.', '2007-11-13 08:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243327, 609838, 30982, '<td valign="top">A bit of an uncomfortable pose - by that I don''t think the dog was uncomfortable... the highlight on the back leg tends to draw the eye and the viewer sort of has to fit that to the dog.  It does fit, but looks awkward, if that makes any sense!  I like the bit of whitein the dog''s eye - sorta gives him/her a sly, knowing look.</td>', 'A bit of an uncomfortable pose - by that I don''t think the dog was uncomfortable... the highlight on the back leg tends to draw the eye and the viewer sort of has to fit that to the dog.  It does fit, but looks awkward, if that makes any sense!  I like the bit of whitein the dog''s eye - sorta gives him/her a sly, knowing look.', '2007-11-13 08:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243329, 611496, 30982, '<td valign="top">Golf cart?  Very large sand trap?  :-)  Most likely it''s a tent, but the first impression I had was a golf cart.  Interesting and different, though I think your ocean is leaking off the the right a little.</td>', 'Golf cart?  Very large sand trap?  :-)  Most likely it''s a tent, but the first impression I had was a golf cart.  Interesting and different, though I think your ocean is leaking off the the right a little.', '2007-11-13 08:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243333, 611698, 30982, '<td valign="top">You''ve got a good model with great attitude here!  Light is a bit harsh - probably need to compensate for the dark background if you let the camera figure an average exposure.  A little less exposure would also fade out the background a bit more, too.  Good pose, great eyes!</td>', 'You''ve got a good model with great attitude here!  Light is a bit harsh - probably need to compensate for the dark background if you let the camera figure an average exposure.  A little less exposure would also fade out the background a bit more, too.  Good pose, great eyes!', '2007-11-13 08:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243336, 610952, 30982, '<td valign="top">No idea what your title means, but I love the oddness of this.</td>', 'No idea what your title means, but I love the oddness of this.', '2007-11-13 08:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243345, 611851, 66348, '<td valign="top">Such a precious look. Love the soft feel to the shot, and the B&amp;W is very fitting. Nice job.</td>', 'Such a precious look. Love the soft feel to the shot, and the B&W is very fitting. Nice job.', '2007-11-13 08:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243347, 611588, 66348, '<td valign="top">Love the tone in this shot, and you captured the drip perfect. Nice work.</td>', 'Love the tone in this shot, and you captured the drip perfect. Nice work.', '2007-11-13 08:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243351, 611022, 66348, '<td valign="top">Grain is rather nice with this shot, however I think the tone you chose doesn''t do this shot justice, I think a deeper brown would have helped IMO. Nice work.</td>', 'Grain is rather nice with this shot, however I think the tone you chose doesn''t do this shot justice, I think a deeper brown would have helped IMO. Nice work.', '2007-11-13 08:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243354, 610847, 66348, '<td valign="top">Beautiful web shot, and great job selecting the blue for you tone it works well with this shot. Nice work.</td>', 'Beautiful web shot, and great job selecting the blue for you tone it works well with this shot. Nice work.', '2007-11-13 08:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243357, 611681, 66348, '<td valign="top">Great use of negative space. I think that this image could use a boost in contrast and perhaps a bit brighter would have helped. Maybe dodging some of the lights and building would have helped IMO.</td>', 'Great use of negative space. I think that this image could use a boost in contrast and perhaps a bit brighter would have helped. Maybe dodging some of the lights and building would have helped IMO.', '2007-11-13 08:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243359, 610417, 66348, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tone, and composition. Has a bit of a MAK or simms or Saberi feel to it. Great DOF and the expression is perfect. 10 from me whoever you are. :)</td>', 'Beautiful tone, and composition. Has a bit of a MAK or simms or Saberi feel to it. Great DOF and the expression is perfect. 10 from me whoever you are. :)', '2007-11-13 08:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243364, 610348, 66348, '<td valign="top">Your lighting is incredible here. Well done with the slight overexposure. Great composition and love the soft feel to the shot. Her expression is great and the editing is spot on. Well done. 10</td>', 'Your lighting is incredible here. Well done with the slight overexposure. Great composition and love the soft feel to the shot. Her expression is great and the editing is spot on. Well done. 10', '2007-11-13 08:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243366, 609838, 81382, '<td valign="top">Some people are saying B&amp;W shouldn''t count as duotone but I think it should. This is nice and sharp on the eyes, good background blurred and nicely composed</td>', 'Some people are saying B&W shouldn''t count as duotone but I think it should. This is nice and sharp on the eyes, good background blurred and nicely composed', '2007-11-13 08:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243369, 611722, 66348, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great image, however I feel the lack of contrast hurt you here. A slight boost in contrast, with some dodging around the face would have made this a stronger shot IMO. I love the expression and your composition is spot on. Well done.</td>', 'I think this is a great image, however I feel the lack of contrast hurt you here. A slight boost in contrast, with some dodging around the face would have made this a stronger shot IMO. I love the expression and your composition is spot on. Well done.', '2007-11-13 08:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243370, 611505, 81382, '<td valign="top">Could have pumped up the highlights to increase contrast. Good choice of tone for the subject, could maybe have cropped in tighter on the three chickens with some space left of the left hand side</td>', 'Could have pumped up the highlights to increase contrast. Good choice of tone for the subject, could maybe have cropped in tighter on the three chickens with some space left of the left hand side', '2007-11-13 08:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243371, 611595, 66348, '<td valign="top">Great street photography and your tone works nice here as well.</td>', 'Great street photography and your tone works nice here as well.', '2007-11-13 08:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243376, 610359, 66348, '<td valign="top">This is great, it made me laugh, if you stand back a bit it looks as if its a mouth with a beard all around. LOL... just great. I really love this shot for many reasons. The composition is right on. The eyes fit great with the tone and flower. I really like the overexposed look. A very well put together shot. 9</td>', 'This is great, it made me laugh, if you stand back a bit it looks as if its a mouth with a beard all around. LOL... just great. I really love this shot for many reasons. The composition is right on. The eyes fit great with the tone and flower. I really like the overexposed look. A very well put together shot. 9', '2007-11-13 08:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243379, 611341, 81382, '<td valign="top">Nice moody sky enhances the building. Could have maybe increased the levels at the top end in the sky to make it more dramatic. Good symmetry. Possibly a slight ccw rotation during the cropping to square up the steps with the bottom of the frame</td>', 'Nice moody sky enhances the building. Could have maybe increased the levels at the top end in the sky to make it more dramatic. Good symmetry. Possibly a slight ccw rotation during the cropping to square up the steps with the bottom of the frame', '2007-11-13 08:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243382, 611559, 66348, '<td valign="top">I am torn on this shot, on one hand I feel its a great old time looking shot and on the other its almost too edited. No i''m just kidding I love it. Great old feel to it. Love the tone you chose and the composition is spot on. Nice work. 9</td>', 'I am torn on this shot, on one hand I feel its a great old time looking shot and on the other its almost too edited. No i''m just kidding I love it. Great old feel to it. Love the tone you chose and the composition is spot on. Nice work. 9', '2007-11-13 08:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243387, 611702, 81382, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp. The light on the left and reflection work well to balance the composition. A slightly wider angle to increase perspective distortion might have made it more dramatic. Could even have cropped out the concrete base of the bridge in the bottom right hand corner to simplify the subject and put more focus on the nice repetetive patterns. Good choice of duotone colour, very subtle</td>', 'Nice and sharp. The light on the left and reflection work well to balance the composition. A slightly wider angle to increase perspective distortion might have made it more dramatic. Could even have cropped out the concrete base of the bridge in the bottom right hand corner to simplify the subject and put more focus on the nice repetetive patterns. Good choice of duotone colour, very subtle', '2007-11-13 08:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243391, 610413, 81382, '<td valign="top">The border is putting me off, maybe if it was same colour as the deepest colour of image or maybe just a little thinner would have been better IMO. Good focus, like the water droplets and great DOF.</td>', 'The border is putting me off, maybe if it was same colour as the deepest colour of image or maybe just a little thinner would have been better IMO. Good focus, like the water droplets and great DOF.', '2007-11-13 08:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243395, 611578, 81382, '<td valign="top">Great composition, you main focal point is a third in from the left and this flower head is the brightest point of the image and everything else blurs and fades away from it which is really clever.</td>', 'Great composition, you main focal point is a third in from the left and this flower head is the brightest point of the image and everything else blurs and fades away from it which is really clever.', '2007-11-13 08:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243396, 611814, 66348, '<td valign="top">Very Larus feel to it. Love the eyes in your shot. Lighting is perfect and composition rocks. I don''t know why but I would almost like to see the crop to just the top of her hair. Beautiful as always. Tell Henny makeup looks great also and am looking forward to her doing mine when I come up for my shoot. :P</td>', 'Very Larus feel to it. Love the eyes in your shot. Lighting is perfect and composition rocks. I don''t know why but I would almost like to see the crop to just the top of her hair. Beautiful as always. Tell Henny makeup looks great also and am looking forward to her doing mine when I come up for my shoot. :P', '2007-11-13 08:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243413, 610894, 81382, '<td valign="top">In your B&amp;W conversion, if it were possible to give greater seperation between the big cat and the rocks then that would have been better. As it is, the tones of the rocks are very similar. Having the rocks much darker to make the main subject stand out more would have been more dramatic. The head is dead center, composition wise, it maybe would have been better more to the left given it is looking to the right</td>', 'In your B&W conversion, if it were possible to give greater seperation between the big cat and the rocks then that would have been better. As it is, the tones of the rocks are very similar. Having the rocks much darker to make the main subject stand out more would have been more dramatic. The head is dead center, composition wise, it maybe would have been better more to the left given it is looking to the right', '2007-11-13 09:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243433, 610765, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the chilly nature of this - almost think it would be more effective in a blue tone to emphasize that chill.  Looks like the sky was burned in a bit (or at least seems at odds with the tones of the rest of the picture) - I prefer them blown over burned but most people do not.</td>', 'I like the chilly nature of this - almost think it would be more effective in a blue tone to emphasize that chill.  Looks like the sky was burned in a bit (or at least seems at odds with the tones of the rest of the picture) - I prefer them blown over burned but most people do not.', '2007-11-13 09:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243434, 611833, 30982, '<td valign="top">Crisp lines and geometry - and a nifty title.</td>', 'Crisp lines and geometry - and a nifty title.', '2007-11-13 09:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243436, 609317, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cute shot and nicely composed to my eye.</td>', 'Cute shot and nicely composed to my eye.', '2007-11-13 09:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243439, 611736, 30982, '<td valign="top">The blue toning is a good choice as it does seem to invite a chill.  It''s a bit otherwise unremarkable.  A possible idea is to try to isolate the bench and the lamp, maybe by blurring the background.</td>', 'The blue toning is a good choice as it does seem to invite a chill.  It''s a bit otherwise unremarkable.  A possible idea is to try to isolate the bench and the lamp, maybe by blurring the background.', '2007-11-13 09:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243440, 611722, 30982, '<td valign="top">The choice of photographing her looking up makes this a more compelling image.</td>', 'The choice of photographing her looking up makes this a more compelling image.', '2007-11-13 09:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243441, 610411, 656, '<td valign="top">I like the repetition going on through the back of the scene.  The strong diagonal breaking up the top and the bottom does interrupt the flow of the scene for me though</td>', 'I like the repetition going on through the back of the scene.  The strong diagonal breaking up the top and the bottom does interrupt the flow of the scene for me though', '2007-11-13 09:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243442, 611533, 30982, '<td valign="top">To me, this looks more like computer generated art than a photograph, though I''m sure it is a photograph (or it wouldn''t be here - duh.)</td>', 'To me, this looks more like computer generated art than a photograph, though I''m sure it is a photograph (or it wouldn''t be here - duh.)', '2007-11-13 09:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243443, 609317, 47541, '<td valign="top">Nice picture but I think for this challenge there are a few things that voters may vote down for.  <br/>1. This is B&amp;W and there is an argument that a B&amp;W is not a Duotone image.  This could be argued for weeks and I doubt that an agreement would be reached.<br/>2. The shadow on the animal''s face means we are drawn to the tree at the right and not to the animal, which we should be.  <br/>3. I feel the shadow is also hiding the area in the image that is sharpest.  Overall the image feels soft and lacking sharpness but from what I can tell the focus is on the little fellas face - we just can''t tell due to the shadows.<br/>4. The border seems wrong.  The top and left are against the edge of the image but what happened to the bottom and right?  I find the best way to add a border is to resize your image smaller than the final size and then increase the canvas size with the border colour.<br/> <br/>As an image goes it is good, I''d vote is middle of the road on it''s own merits, the lighting is the biggest issue for me.  You may also like to try a portrait crop that covers the left half of the image as that may direct viewers to the animal more.</td>', 'Nice picture but I think for this challenge there are a few things that voters may vote down for.  1. This is B&W and there is an argument that a B&W is not a Duotone image.  This could be argued for weeks and I doubt that an agreement would be reached.2. The shadow on the animal''s face means we are drawn to the tree at the right and not to the animal, which we should be.  3. I feel the shadow is also hiding the area in the image that is sharpest.  Overall the image feels soft and lacking sharpness but from what I can tell the focus is on the little fellas face - we just can''t tell due to the shadows.4. The border seems wrong.  The top and left are against the edge of the image but what happened to the bottom and right?  I find the best way to add a border is to resize your image smaller than the final size and then increase the canvas size with the border colour. As an image goes it is good, I''d vote is middle of the road on it''s own merits, the lighting is the biggest issue for me.  You may also like to try a portrait crop that covers the left half of the image as that may direct viewers to the animal more.', '2007-11-13 09:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243444, 610934, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very striking shot of this structure - love how only some of the windows have lightin them, the rest are dark.  Nice sky as well.</td>', 'A very striking shot of this structure - love how only some of the windows have lightin them, the rest are dark.  Nice sky as well.', '2007-11-13 09:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243445, 610359, 656, '<td valign="top">The flower adds a somewhat surreal element to this that really plays well with the bright, sharp eyes.  The repeating shape adds the third point to a triangle that really keeps the shot moving.  Like the somewhat unusual orange duotoning, too.</td>', 'The flower adds a somewhat surreal element to this that really plays well with the bright, sharp eyes.  The repeating shape adds the third point to a triangle that really keeps the shot moving.  Like the somewhat unusual orange duotoning, too.', '2007-11-13 09:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243448, 611208, 656, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure the large amount of negative space in the foreground is working for me.  She feels like she''s levitating</td>', 'I''m not sure the large amount of negative space in the foreground is working for me.  She feels like she''s levitating', '2007-11-13 09:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243449, 611585, 656, '<td valign="top">good use of the light</td>', 'good use of the light', '2007-11-13 09:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243450, 611693, 656, '<td valign="top">actually feels really sharp - think maybe a bit too much given the title and theme.</td>', 'actually feels really sharp - think maybe a bit too much given the title and theme.', '2007-11-13 09:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243453, 609237, 656, '<td valign="top">has potential.  I''d like to see them on different steps to maybe make it a touch more dynamic, give it some depth and movement.</td>', 'has potential.  I''d like to see them on different steps to maybe make it a touch more dynamic, give it some depth and movement.', '2007-11-13 09:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243455, 611368, 81382, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple portrait. Good focus and well composed (although could have had a touch more empty space to the right for a bit more balance). Good choice of warm duotone hue</td>', 'Nice and simple portrait. Good focus and well composed (although could have had a touch more empty space to the right for a bit more balance). Good choice of warm duotone hue', '2007-11-13 09:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243457, 610952, 656, '<td valign="top">certainly unusual posing.  Feels half way towards classical statues, with just a more central positioning of them at the front of the columns.  What''s with the mystery jacket on the right ?</td>', 'certainly unusual posing.  Feels half way towards classical statues, with just a more central positioning of them at the front of the columns.  What''s with the mystery jacket on the right ?', '2007-11-13 09:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243461, 610242, 656, '<td valign="top">she seems somewhat random in the scene, like she just fell out of the sky.  Might make more sense as part of a series of similarly themed images</td>', 'she seems somewhat random in the scene, like she just fell out of the sky.  Might make more sense as part of a series of similarly themed images', '2007-11-13 09:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243465, 611796, 656, '<td valign="top">the light doesn''t help this shot as it really takes away from looking at the textures in the wood.  Some diffusion (clouds, or man made) might help, then you could work the composition some more.</td>', 'the light doesn''t help this shot as it really takes away from looking at the textures in the wood.  Some diffusion (clouds, or man made) might help, then you could work the composition some more.', '2007-11-13 09:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243466, 612278, 81382, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple and composed dead in the centre which is not often advised (rule of thirds) but it works here. Its just a shame its not a lot sharper and with a lot more contrast; the brightest point in the image could be stretched out quite a bit using curves or levels in PS to make it more dramatic and cover the hole duotone range</td>', 'Nice and simple and composed dead in the centre which is not often advised (rule of thirds) but it works here. Its just a shame its not a lot sharper and with a lot more contrast; the brightest point in the image could be stretched out quite a bit using curves or levels in PS to make it more dramatic and cover the hole duotone range', '2007-11-13 09:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243469, 611739, 656, '<td valign="top">you''ve got her in good light on what appears to be a quite harshly lit day and the interaction/ ''pose'' is great too.</td>', 'you''ve got her in good light on what appears to be a quite harshly lit day and the interaction/ ''pose'' is great too.', '2007-11-13 09:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
