(4243473, 611565, 81382, '<td valign="top">Perhaps the duotone hue is a little on the strong side. A darker border to match the could of the childs hair may have improved overall tonal balance. Nicely composed though</td>', 'Perhaps the duotone hue is a little on the strong side. A darker border to match the could of the childs hair may have improved overall tonal balance. Nicely composed though', '2007-11-13 09:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
