(4243485, 610930, 81382, '<td valign="top">Interesting border. Seems to me though like it could have done with a slight ccw rotation to square up the very dominant horizontal lines. Nice effect on the sky coming in through the trees</td>', 'Interesting border. Seems to me though like it could have done with a slight ccw rotation to square up the very dominant horizontal lines. Nice effect on the sky coming in through the trees', '2007-11-13 09:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
