(4243500, 611738, 30982, '<td valign="top">Generally DPC voters don''t care much for stuffed toy shots (I know, I tried!) but they are a good way to learn composition, lighting, etc.  The lighting here is pretty even, but for this shot to really work, you need to have crisp focus on both the papa and the baby.  Focus seems to be a bit more on the baby in this case.  A less patterned background would put more focus on the subjects, too.</td>', 'Generally DPC voters don''t care much for stuffed toy shots (I know, I tried!) but they are a good way to learn composition, lighting, etc.  The lighting here is pretty even, but for this shot to really work, you need to have crisp focus on both the papa and the baby.  Focus seems to be a bit more on the baby in this case.  A less patterned background would put more focus on the subjects, too.', '2007-11-13 09:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243501, 610882, 70875, '<td valign="top">The colors are nice..but I''m not sure about the square crop..maybe a landscape or a portrait could be more interesting.</td>', 'The colors are nice..but I''m not sure about the square crop..maybe a landscape or a portrait could be more interesting.', '2007-11-13 09:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
