(4245530, 611814, 28882, '<td valign="top">I think this is kinda weird and don''t understand the point of the paint, but the tones and lighting are so impressive,  9</td>', 'I think this is kinda weird and don''t understand the point of the paint, but the tones and lighting are so impressive,  9', '2007-11-14 01:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4245547, 611694, 28882, '<td valign="top">i liked the image from first glance but as i study this i''m finding some faults, like the cut off mast, and some weird processing effecting the sky, I was thinking about dropping the score a bit, but after some thought i think i''ll leave the score i first gave it (8).  I think the first glance score should hold lots of weight after all that''s all many photos get, just a glance.</td>', 'i liked the image from first glance but as i study this i''m finding some faults, like the cut off mast, and some weird processing effecting the sky, I was thinking about dropping the score a bit, but after some thought i think i''ll leave the score i first gave it (8).  I think the first glance score should hold lots of weight after all that''s all many photos get, just a glance.', '2007-11-14 01:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4245565, 610745, 28882, '<td valign="top">this photo is impressing on many levels, i love the range of tone quality not that it reaches the extreme blacks or whites but because it doesn''t and still looks great.   i like the composition and the reflection.  It has a nice balance.  This is a very peaceful image too, the sky, water and deserted looking structure.  very nice. 8</td>', 'this photo is impressing on many levels, i love the range of tone quality not that it reaches the extreme blacks or whites but because it doesn''t and still looks great.   i like the composition and the reflection.  It has a nice balance.  This is a very peaceful image too, the sky, water and deserted looking structure.  very nice. 8', '2007-11-14 01:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4245569, 610076, 28882, '<td valign="top">I gave this a high score because i just liked the color and the black bg. 8</td>', 'I gave this a high score because i just liked the color and the black bg. 8', '2007-11-14 01:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4245580, 611710, 28882, '<td valign="top">I thiiiink this one borderlines on dnmc.  I don''t really know.  Seems like the greys and golds together cross the line.  I know i''m probably wrong about this so just in case I''ll not consider it.  I like the image alot and i love the reflections and clarity of the buildings. 8</td>', 'I thiiiink this one borderlines on dnmc.  I don''t really know.  Seems like the greys and golds together cross the line.  I know i''m probably wrong about this so just in case I''ll not consider it.  I like the image alot and i love the reflections and clarity of the buildings. 8', '2007-11-14 01:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4245586, 609783, 28882, '<td valign="top">the sky does it for me,  and there''s some undefinable feeling i get from it that i like, it seems almost toyish.  8</td>', 'the sky does it for me,  and there''s some undefinable feeling i get from it that i like, it seems almost toyish.  8', '2007-11-14 01:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
