(4245593, 612232, 28882, '<td valign="top">a wonderful sky image.  that''s my first thought.  I like the old barn too.  If i were here taking this shot i''d go over and investigate it too, go play in it.   nice capture.  8</td>', 'a wonderful sky image.  that''s my first thought.  I like the old barn too.  If i were here taking this shot i''d go over and investigate it too, go play in it.   nice capture.  8', '2007-11-14 01:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4245600, 611406, 28882, '<td valign="top">don''t really know how to rate this one.  On the one hand i like the feel and presence it has.  I like the range of tone and the color, but... I just feel like it''s toooo surreal, if that''s possible.  almost like it''s not even a photo.  I''ll give it an 8.</td>', 'don''t really know how to rate this one.  On the one hand i like the feel and presence it has.  I like the range of tone and the color, but... I just feel like it''s toooo surreal, if that''s possible.  almost like it''s not even a photo.  I''ll give it an 8.', '2007-11-14 02:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4245609, 611401, 28882, '<td valign="top">this is another one of my favorite images in the challenge.  i love the shadows and the brick texture.  the cut off person adds to the mystery that this image is all about.  gave it a 7 at first, bumping to 9</td>', 'this is another one of my favorite images in the challenge.  i love the shadows and the brick texture.  the cut off person adds to the mystery that this image is all about.  gave it a 7 at first, bumping to 9', '2007-11-14 02:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4245614, 610413, 28882, '<td valign="top">gave this a 7 from just my initial feel about it.  somehow the inversion of the flower gives it an extra kick.  love the soft pink too.</td>', 'gave this a 7 from just my initial feel about it.  somehow the inversion of the flower gives it an extra kick.  love the soft pink too.', '2007-11-14 02:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4245616, 611740, 28882, '<td valign="top">i think the blue here is wonderful.  the clarity is also great.  7</td>', 'i think the blue here is wonderful.  the clarity is also great.  7', '2007-11-14 02:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4245628, 610182, 28882, '<td valign="top">one of my favorites in this challenge.  After i got over the sickly green face, i fell in love with this beautiful child and her long hair.  Often the subject is all you need to make a great photo.  ...also a good photographer to capture it. ;-)  That backlighting works wonders too.  7, no lets make it an 8</td>', 'one of my favorites in this challenge.  After i got over the sickly green face, i fell in love with this beautiful child and her long hair.  Often the subject is all you need to make a great photo.  ...also a good photographer to capture it. ;-)  That backlighting works wonders too.  7, no lets make it an 8', '2007-11-14 02:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4245631, 611557, 28882, '<td valign="top">i''ve been trying to figure out what that thing is.  nice image and nice tones.  7</td>', 'i''ve been trying to figure out what that thing is.  nice image and nice tones.  7', '2007-11-14 02:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4245640, 611734, 28882, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this.  Looks just like a post card from a basket company.  great tone and range.  7</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this.  Looks just like a post card from a basket company.  great tone and range.  7', '2007-11-14 02:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4245645, 611063, 28882, '<td valign="top">simple, nice and it works, i like the lighting and softness.  7</td>', 'simple, nice and it works, i like the lighting and softness.  7', '2007-11-14 02:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4245649, 610761, 28882, '<td valign="top">sometimes it''s just the simple things huh?   7</td>', 'sometimes it''s just the simple things huh?   7', '2007-11-14 02:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4245662, 612281, 28882, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7 mostly because you captured some emotional substance coming out here,  actually i think the technicals aren''t that special, a little soft.</td>', 'I gave this a 7 mostly because you captured some emotional substance coming out here,  actually i think the technicals aren''t that special, a little soft.', '2007-11-14 02:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
