(4247244, 610592, 81382, '<td valign="top">Interesting title.... if only the surface was sharper, it looks a bit like a game texture mapped rendered object, especially with the "polygonal" outline at the top, if this has been masked, greater care to make sure it was perfectly circular would have made a difference but I might be wrong</td>', 'Interesting title.... if only the surface was sharper, it looks a bit like a game texture mapped rendered object, especially with the "polygonal" outline at the top, if this has been masked, greater care to make sure it was perfectly circular would have made a difference but I might be wrong', '2007-11-14 15:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4247248, 611710, 81382, '<td valign="top">Interesting hue choices. With the lighting and grid like windows in the buildings it almost looks like a computer generated wireframe artists impression of an inner city regeneration proposal. Great reflections too. A slight ccw rotation to square up the central building a bit would have made it spot on for me</td>', 'Interesting hue choices. With the lighting and grid like windows in the buildings it almost looks like a computer generated wireframe artists impression of an inner city regeneration proposal. Great reflections too. A slight ccw rotation to square up the central building a bit would have made it spot on for me', '2007-11-14 15:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4247256, 611611, 81382, '<td valign="top">The tree areas look a bit flat in tonal range. Perhaps a different mix of hues during the B&amp;W converstion could have pushed the woodland contrast more to make it more dramatic</td>', 'The tree areas look a bit flat in tonal range. Perhaps a different mix of hues during the B&W converstion could have pushed the woodland contrast more to make it more dramatic', '2007-11-14 15:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4247261, 610885, 81382, '<td valign="top">Interesting aspect ratio. Not a fan of the specular highlight on the cylinder. Would have been good to eliminate the bright white "spot" to the far left as it distracts the eye</td>', 'Interesting aspect ratio. Not a fan of the specular highlight on the cylinder. Would have been good to eliminate the bright white "spot" to the far left as it distracts the eye', '2007-11-14 15:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4247263, 611558, 81382, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the moment. To be able to clearly see both faces would have allowed me to score higher. Good tonal range and sharpness of the girls against the blurred background</td>', 'Great capture of the moment. To be able to clearly see both faces would have allowed me to score higher. Good tonal range and sharpness of the girls against the blurred background', '2007-11-14 15:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
