(4247270, 609404, 81382, '<td valign="top">Great patterns. The vertical lines seem to lean ever so slightly to the left. A very small cw rotation during the cropping stage would have been a consideration. Good contrast and sharpness across the whole image</td>', 'Great patterns. The vertical lines seem to lean ever so slightly to the left. A very small cw rotation during the cropping stage would have been a consideration. Good contrast and sharpness across the whole image', '2007-11-14 15:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
