(4247536, 611801, 66384, '<td valign="top">The paleness and the slight green cast, makes his face look cadaverous to me. I like the capture and the composition, just not crazy about the tone.</td>', 'The paleness and the slight green cast, makes his face look cadaverous to me. I like the capture and the composition, just not crazy about the tone.', '2007-11-14 16:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
