(4247550, 611694, 66384, '<td valign="top">Exquisite processing. I love the glassy water. The composition seems a bit heavy on the left, and the mast cuts the image straight down the middle.</td>', 'Exquisite processing. I love the glassy water. The composition seems a bit heavy on the left, and the mast cuts the image straight down the middle.', '2007-11-14 17:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
