(4248287, 611700, 28882, '<td valign="top">the low contrast gives it the feel of a old faded photo.  Also being of a building reminds me of some town museum photos they display to preserve they''re heritage.  7</td>', 'the low contrast gives it the feel of a old faded photo.  Also being of a building reminds me of some town museum photos they display to preserve they''re heritage.  7', '2007-11-14 23:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248288, 611728, 28882, '<td valign="top">i think it would help for the person to be lighter but the image overall looks good being darker like this.  I like the depth of field and the crossed legs.  7</td>', 'i think it would help for the person to be lighter but the image overall looks good being darker like this.  I like the depth of field and the crossed legs.  7', '2007-11-14 23:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248289, 611825, 48697, '<td valign="top">I like the PP and the tone in this shot. I will say at first I didn''t care for the image b/c I''m not a big fan of motion blur. But as I really looked at the image and put the pieces together I think I get it now. The power lines are the puppet strings controlling the person as he moves. I could also take this as a "going green statement" as to break free of the power dependancy. Maybe I''m reading to much into this shot but I think it does a good job of conveying a message, well done!</td>', 'I like the PP and the tone in this shot. I will say at first I didn''t care for the image b/c I''m not a big fan of motion blur. But as I really looked at the image and put the pieces together I think I get it now. The power lines are the puppet strings controlling the person as he moves. I could also take this as a "going green statement" as to break free of the power dependancy. Maybe I''m reading to much into this shot but I think it does a good job of conveying a message, well done!', '2007-11-14 23:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248292, 611509, 28882, '<td valign="top">i like the detail of the lower leaf and the color tones are great.  I don''t like the top leaf in the upper center. too oof.  the placement takes away from the lower sharper leaf.  I like the light in the background and the shadows there. 6</td>', 'i like the detail of the lower leaf and the color tones are great.  I don''t like the top leaf in the upper center. too oof.  the placement takes away from the lower sharper leaf.  I like the light in the background and the shadows there. 6', '2007-11-14 23:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248296, 611758, 28882, '<td valign="top">this is a great subject and it''s nice and sharp.  one thing that i noticed is that there is a couple of things that makes this a little hard to interpret.  One is that the foreground and the background are too close in color/tone and the fact that the animal''s head is turned and blends in with its side.  6</td>', 'this is a great subject and it''s nice and sharp.  one thing that i noticed is that there is a couple of things that makes this a little hard to interpret.  One is that the foreground and the background are too close in color/tone and the fact that the animal''s head is turned and blends in with its side.  6', '2007-11-14 23:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248299, 611368, 28882, '<td valign="top">cute girl.  I would prefer to see this in another more natural color.  very nice though. 6</td>', 'cute girl.  I would prefer to see this in another more natural color.  very nice though. 6', '2007-11-14 23:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
