(4248536, 611463, 76430, '<td valign="top">I see you took the liberal definition of duotone, white plus two other colors.  Good desat picture and DOF.  I might like it better if the front crosses were in focus rather than a bit back, but that''s just MHO.  It''s busy, but I like that the crosses fill the entire frame.</td>', 'I see you took the liberal definition of duotone, white plus two other colors.  Good desat picture and DOF.  I might like it better if the front crosses were in focus rather than a bit back, but that''s just MHO.  It''s busy, but I like that the crosses fill the entire frame.', '2007-11-15 02:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
