(4249197, 610407, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, beautiful tones.  One suggestion, line up the side of the window to the side of the picture (straighten the picture - I know it''s straightened to the top of the picture, but it looks tilted).</td>', 'Nice picture, beautiful tones.  One suggestion, line up the side of the window to the side of the picture (straighten the picture - I know it''s straightened to the top of the picture, but it looks tilted).', '2007-11-15 11:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
