(4249204, 610765, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful candid.  However, the processing is too much IMO.  It looks over noise-ninjaed (or similar), and also maybe too much USM?  A picture like this needs to have more natural detail.  Also, the sky looks blueish/gray (not a duotone).  -4</td>', 'Beautiful candid.  However, the processing is too much IMO.  It looks over noise-ninjaed (or similar), and also maybe too much USM?  A picture like this needs to have more natural detail.  Also, the sky looks blueish/gray (not a duotone).  -4', '2007-11-15 11:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
