(4250972, 610641, 6999, '<td valign="top">I rather enjoy this, although the processing is bizarre at the very least, and perhaps distracts from the integrity of a fine image...<br/> <br/>... made me think though. Still can''t see why it should be made to look like it was torn out of an old magazine. Can''t see why not either, mind you ...</td>', 'I rather enjoy this, although the processing is bizarre at the very least, and perhaps distracts from the integrity of a fine image... ... made me think though. Still can''t see why it should be made to look like it was torn out of an old magazine. Can''t see why not either, mind you ...', '2007-11-16 03:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4250987, 611460, 17513, '<td valign="top">i think this picture is beautiful...i love the position of the bodies and how they are looking into  each others eyes.lovely well done..if i could vote would be 10/10</td>', 'i think this picture is beautiful...i love the position of the bodies and how they are looking into  each others eyes.lovely well done..if i could vote would be 10/10', '2007-11-16 04:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
