(4251967, 611480, 66348, '<td valign="top">Your editing works very well on this type of shot, the tone works nicely as well. I think if the letter filled more of the frame however, it would have been a stronger image, IMO. Nice work.</td>', 'Your editing works very well on this type of shot, the tone works nicely as well. I think if the letter filled more of the frame however, it would have been a stronger image, IMO. Nice work.', '2007-11-16 13:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4251968, 610673, 66348, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful expression, pose, and tone. Silky is exactly what I thought when I saw this. Nice work.</td>', 'Very beautiful expression, pose, and tone. Silky is exactly what I thought when I saw this. Nice work.', '2007-11-16 13:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4251974, 611146, 66348, '<td valign="top">I like how this fills the frame. It has a great tone and really great pattern, nice work.</td>', 'I like how this fills the frame. It has a great tone and really great pattern, nice work.', '2007-11-16 13:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4251980, 610413, 66348, '<td valign="top">Great angle, and lovely tone. Composition is nice DOF works well. Nice job.</td>', 'Great angle, and lovely tone. Composition is nice DOF works well. Nice job.', '2007-11-16 14:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4251984, 611471, 66348, '<td valign="top">You really did get a great capture and expression here. Very nice B&amp;W and perfect composition. Nice job.</td>', 'You really did get a great capture and expression here. Very nice B&W and perfect composition. Nice job.', '2007-11-16 14:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4251986, 611028, 811, '<td valign="top">Indeed, very noble looking.  Great clarity and detail.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Indeed, very noble looking.  Great clarity and detail.  Nicely done.', '2007-11-16 14:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4251988, 609675, 66348, '<td valign="top">Great composition and leading lines to the lighthouse. Nice tone as well.</td>', 'Great composition and leading lines to the lighthouse. Nice tone as well.', '2007-11-16 14:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4251990, 609377, 811, '<td valign="top">Great depth in this shot.  I like that the details such as the running condensation on the glass is visible.</td>', 'Great depth in this shot.  I like that the details such as the running condensation on the glass is visible.', '2007-11-16 14:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4251993, 611814, 811, '<td valign="top">that is an interesting effect.</td>', 'that is an interesting effect.', '2007-11-16 14:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4251995, 611803, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like how you have lit this.</td>', 'I really like how you have lit this.', '2007-11-16 14:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252001, 611470, 66348, '<td valign="top">I really like your composition and tone, but it almost looks a little too posed. It may be a candid but its just the way it appears. Dont get me wrong, there is nothing wrong with posed, I do it all the time. I think your contrast is right on the money and so is the sharpness and clarity. Your lighting works very good as well. Nice work.</td>', 'I really like your composition and tone, but it almost looks a little too posed. It may be a candid but its just the way it appears. Dont get me wrong, there is nothing wrong with posed, I do it all the time. I think your contrast is right on the money and so is the sharpness and clarity. Your lighting works very good as well. Nice work.', '2007-11-16 14:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252002, 611801, 811, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the detail.</td>', 'Great capture of the detail.', '2007-11-16 14:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252003, 611607, 811, '<td valign="top">Focus seems a bit off in general, though it is difficult to pinpoint where.  Also, it is a bit flat in tone.  Perhaps boosting contrast would help.</td>', 'Focus seems a bit off in general, though it is difficult to pinpoint where.  Also, it is a bit flat in tone.  Perhaps boosting contrast would help.', '2007-11-16 14:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252004, 609873, 66348, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, but if I may...if you look closely around the bird you will see a white, what looks like an outline. This is caused from oversharpnening, and many times unsharp mask. Using a lighter sharpen will help. Great composition though.</td>', 'Nice capture, but if I may...if you look closely around the bird you will see a white, what looks like an outline. This is caused from oversharpnening, and many times unsharp mask. Using a lighter sharpen will help. Great composition though.', '2007-11-16 14:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252013, 611704, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this.  Also, it has a nice level of contrast too.  I am seeing some artifacting along the straight edges which I presume came from resizing.  I don''t know your workflow, but I have found that if I resize in small steps it helps reduce that some.</td>', 'I like the composition of this.  Also, it has a nice level of contrast too.  I am seeing some artifacting along the straight edges which I presume came from resizing.  I don''t know your workflow, but I have found that if I resize in small steps it helps reduce that some.', '2007-11-16 14:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252014, 610708, 66348, '<td valign="top">Great expression and capture. Nice tone used as well.</td>', 'Great expression and capture. Nice tone used as well.', '2007-11-16 14:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252015, 611547, 811, '<td valign="top">Good composition</td>', 'Good composition', '2007-11-16 14:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252016, 611463, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of the colors and how the "poppies" repeat throughout the frame.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of the colors and how the "poppies" repeat throughout the frame.', '2007-11-16 14:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252019, 611839, 66348, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and angle you took on this challenge. I like the blue tone. At first glance I thought this would have looked better in Sepia but when your title said angel, it was very fitting it was blue. So nice work.</td>', 'I really like the composition and angle you took on this challenge. I like the blue tone. At first glance I thought this would have looked better in Sepia but when your title said angel, it was very fitting it was blue. So nice work.', '2007-11-16 14:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252023, 611022, 811, '<td valign="top">I actually like the grain in this shot -- it gives it a desolate "dust bowl" type of feeling.</td>', 'I actually like the grain in this shot -- it gives it a desolate "dust bowl" type of feeling.', '2007-11-16 14:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252027, 609594, 811, '<td valign="top">I find myself trying to rotate this to a vertical . . .like this it feels like it is falling over.</td>', 'I find myself trying to rotate this to a vertical . . .like this it feels like it is falling over.', '2007-11-16 14:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252028, 611066, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice reflections.  I also like the clear crisp lines.</td>', 'Nice reflections.  I also like the clear crisp lines.', '2007-11-16 14:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252030, 610616, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective from which is this is shot.  The focus seems just a touch off, though.</td>', 'I like the perspective from which is this is shot.  The focus seems just a touch off, though.', '2007-11-16 14:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252033, 610738, 811, '<td valign="top">Good composition, but a touch dark, I think.</td>', 'Good composition, but a touch dark, I think.', '2007-11-16 14:13:59.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4252035, 611638, 811, '<td valign="top">Glad the guy on the left is smiling, otherwise they would be scary!</td>', 'Glad the guy on the left is smiling, otherwise they would be scary!', '2007-11-16 14:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252036, 611341, 811, '<td valign="top">Spooky feeling, almost.</td>', 'Spooky feeling, almost.', '2007-11-16 14:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252039, 610543, 811, '<td valign="top">I like how the symmetry and how it fades at the top</td>', 'I like how the symmetry and how it fades at the top', '2007-11-16 14:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252041, 611710, 86026, '<td valign="top">FINALLY someone actually did a duotone... 8 .. way to go.<br/> <br/>p.s. - straighen your horizon</td>', 'FINALLY someone actually did a duotone... 8 .. way to go. p.s. - straighen your horizon', '2007-11-16 14:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252042, 610746, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the high contrast, but the focus seems just a touch off to me.</td>', 'I like the high contrast, but the focus seems just a touch off to me.', '2007-11-16 14:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252044, 609350, 811, '<td valign="top">this shot evokes a "forgotten feeling."  good work</td>', 'this shot evokes a "forgotten feeling."  good work', '2007-11-16 14:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252045, 611752, 811, '<td valign="top">this has a very surreal, sci-fi, after annihilation feeling to it</td>', 'this has a very surreal, sci-fi, after annihilation feeling to it', '2007-11-16 14:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252048, 610405, 811, '<td valign="top">These little guys think they can do it all, don''t they!</td>', 'These little guys think they can do it all, don''t they!', '2007-11-16 14:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252050, 611509, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like this one, though it is difficult for me to find the words to describe why.</td>', 'I really like this one, though it is difficult for me to find the words to describe why.', '2007-11-16 14:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252052, 612230, 811, '<td valign="top">Good action capture</td>', 'Good action capture', '2007-11-16 14:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252053, 610871, 46832, '<td valign="top">Looks like the tornado was added in post processing.  You may get DQ''d.</td>', 'Looks like the tornado was added in post processing.  You may get DQ''d.', '2007-11-16 14:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252063, 611599, 46832, '<td valign="top">Red makes it a tri-tone - not a duotone.</td>', 'Red makes it a tri-tone - not a duotone.', '2007-11-16 14:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252082, 611333, 46832, '<td valign="top">Pink makes it a tri-tone - not a duotone.  Very nice otherwise.</td>', 'Pink makes it a tri-tone - not a duotone.  Very nice otherwise.', '2007-11-16 14:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252086, 611375, 46832, '<td valign="top">Blue, red and white makes it a tri-tone - not a duotone.</td>', 'Blue, red and white makes it a tri-tone - not a duotone.', '2007-11-16 14:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252098, 610511, 46832, '<td valign="top">Nope, tritone... red, white, blue.</td>', 'Nope, tritone... red, white, blue.', '2007-11-16 14:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252105, 612284, 811, '<td valign="top">the coloring fits the subject, i think</td>', 'the coloring fits the subject, i think', '2007-11-16 14:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252106, 611835, 811, '<td valign="top">nice shot -- i like the high contrast in this</td>', 'nice shot -- i like the high contrast in this', '2007-11-16 14:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252109, 611128, 23002, '<td valign="top">Great image.  The processing really fits with the downtrodden, depressed feel of this.</td>', 'Great image.  The processing really fits with the downtrodden, depressed feel of this.', '2007-11-16 14:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252111, 612223, 81382, '<td valign="top">Excellent tones, spoilt only by the white area at the very top which interferes with the composition</td>', 'Excellent tones, spoilt only by the white area at the very top which interferes with the composition', '2007-11-16 14:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252116, 611480, 23002, '<td valign="top">very nice processing on this rather depressing message.  The duotone effect really works well  here.</td>', 'very nice processing on this rather depressing message.  The duotone effect really works well  here.', '2007-11-16 14:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252118, 611835, 81382, '<td valign="top">Amazing light and detail on the wings, the swan is the main focus and is clearly the brightest area which is good... apart from the border of course which is a little wide and might have been better in black</td>', 'Amazing light and detail on the wings, the swan is the main focus and is clearly the brightest area which is good... apart from the border of course which is a little wide and might have been better in black', '2007-11-16 14:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252121, 610529, 811, '<td valign="top">I must confess, at first the cigar seemed a bit out of place. :)  Great lighting in this, though.</td>', 'I must confess, at first the cigar seemed a bit out of place. :)  Great lighting in this, though.', '2007-11-16 14:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252122, 610109, 811, '<td valign="top">I like how the goals seemed to be placed randomly</td>', 'I like how the goals seemed to be placed randomly', '2007-11-16 14:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252123, 611120, 23002, '<td valign="top">It looks like you were going for a moody type image here.  Unfortunatly by underexposing it to get that effect, it makes the shot sort of "muddy", and it loses it''s appeal to me. The frame is also much too large IMHO.</td>', 'It looks like you were going for a moody type image here.  Unfortunatly by underexposing it to get that effect, it makes the shot sort of "muddy", and it loses it''s appeal to me. The frame is also much too large IMHO.', '2007-11-16 14:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252124, 610511, 81382, '<td valign="top">Given you have had to mention the two colours in the title is worrying and clearly may go against the challenge requirement.</td>', 'Given you have had to mention the two colours in the title is worrying and clearly may go against the challenge requirement.', '2007-11-16 14:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252125, 610930, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the softness of this. Feels tilted, though</td>', 'I like the softness of this. Feels tilted, though', '2007-11-16 14:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252127, 610703, 811, '<td valign="top">a very well balanced composition</td>', 'a very well balanced composition', '2007-11-16 14:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252129, 611436, 23002, '<td valign="top">Misplaced or purposely dumped? Either way it is an interesting use of negative space.  It fits the challenge as well, with limited tones, but it lacks impact.</td>', 'Misplaced or purposely dumped? Either way it is an interesting use of negative space.  It fits the challenge as well, with limited tones, but it lacks impact.', '2007-11-16 14:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252133, 611120, 81382, '<td valign="top">The background being much brighter leads the eye away from the main subject. One of the widest borders I have seen and I am not too sure about it. The hand is more well lit and seem more in focus than the face which is a shame</td>', 'The background being much brighter leads the eye away from the main subject. One of the widest borders I have seen and I am not too sure about it. The hand is more well lit and seem more in focus than the face which is a shame', '2007-11-16 14:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252134, 610208, 811, '<td valign="top">Good capture.  I like the lighting on this -- it fits with the action</td>', 'Good capture.  I like the lighting on this -- it fits with the action', '2007-11-16 14:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252135, 610613, 811, '<td valign="top">I LIKE all of those lines -- that is a cool effect.</td>', 'I LIKE all of those lines -- that is a cool effect.', '2007-11-16 14:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252137, 611839, 81382, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Choice of duotone hue is questionable for me. The really subtle ones look better IMO. Good focus</td>', 'Great capture. Choice of duotone hue is questionable for me. The really subtle ones look better IMO. Good focus', '2007-11-16 14:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252138, 610242, 23002, '<td valign="top">wow.  powerful sky, great dof, wonderful processing, &amp; of course a half naked woman....it''s a winner!  (I am going to guess this is Judi''s)...if it is not hers, take it as a compliment, she does excellent work very similar to this!  10</td>', 'wow.  powerful sky, great dof, wonderful processing, & of course a half naked woman....it''s a winner!  (I am going to guess this is Judi''s)...if it is not hers, take it as a compliment, she does excellent work very similar to this!  10', '2007-11-16 14:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252142, 611588, 81382, '<td valign="top">Strong duotone hue which works well here in this context. It won''t win many awards for originality though, especially as there is a dedicated tutorial on DPC explaining exactly how to reproduce this</td>', 'Strong duotone hue which works well here in this context. It won''t win many awards for originality though, especially as there is a dedicated tutorial on DPC explaining exactly how to reproduce this', '2007-11-16 14:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252144, 611332, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the harsh lighting -- adds to the mood, I think</td>', 'I like the harsh lighting -- adds to the mood, I think', '2007-11-16 15:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252146, 611195, 811, '<td valign="top">good detail</td>', 'good detail', '2007-11-16 15:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252147, 610368, 23002, '<td valign="top">Great DOF, nice scenery.  Unfortunately it looks like you purposely underexposed this image to add to the duotone effect.  I do not feel that this is paricularly effective on this shot.  I would love to see this shot with lots of contrast.</td>', 'Great DOF, nice scenery.  Unfortunately it looks like you purposely underexposed this image to add to the duotone effect.  I do not feel that this is paricularly effective on this shot.  I would love to see this shot with lots of contrast.', '2007-11-16 15:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252148, 611213, 81382, '<td valign="top">If only the background was a lot darker. Possibly would consider cropping out the second cheetah on the right hand side; composition wise, having two main subjects doesn''t make for easy viewing and would have had a lot more impact if there was just the one of the left perfecty composed</td>', 'If only the background was a lot darker. Possibly would consider cropping out the second cheetah on the right hand side; composition wise, having two main subjects doesn''t make for easy viewing and would have had a lot more impact if there was just the one of the left perfecty composed', '2007-11-16 15:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252149, 611740, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the motion of this and how it leads you to the upper right</td>', 'I like the motion of this and how it leads you to the upper right', '2007-11-16 15:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252150, 611401, 20168, '<td valign="top">classy entry and stand out in unique composition and design 8</td>', 'classy entry and stand out in unique composition and design 8', '2007-11-16 15:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252151, 611585, 81382, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, good choice of hue for the duetone. A lot of people have gone for the very subtle blue/grey shade but this would have been too cold for this sunlight image</td>', 'Great lighting, good choice of hue for the duetone. A lot of people have gone for the very subtle blue/grey shade but this would have been too cold for this sunlight image', '2007-11-16 15:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252152, 609907, 20168, '<td valign="top">lovely celebration of fall with good choice for duotone 8</td>', 'lovely celebration of fall with good choice for duotone 8', '2007-11-16 15:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252155, 611810, 23002, '<td valign="top">Interesting processing adds to an otherwise "snapshot" type image.  I am not fond of the bright highlights on the top right, and think that being able to make eye contact with the subject would help as well.</td>', 'Interesting processing adds to an otherwise "snapshot" type image.  I am not fond of the bright highlights on the top right, and think that being able to make eye contact with the subject would help as well.', '2007-11-16 15:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252156, 611452, 81382, '<td valign="top">Interesting viewpoint which immediately adds impact. Well composed too.</td>', 'Interesting viewpoint which immediately adds impact. Well composed too.', '2007-11-16 15:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252159, 609404, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the way this shot is filled with the repeating patterns</td>', 'I like the way this shot is filled with the repeating patterns', '2007-11-16 15:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252160, 611485, 20168, '<td valign="top">lovely nature abstract capturing the lightplay within creation</td>', 'lovely nature abstract capturing the lightplay within creation', '2007-11-16 15:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252162, 611746, 23002, '<td valign="top">I love the grainy effect here.  the slightly off center subject and the great expression also help.<br/> <br/>Although I am finding all these bleak shots in the challenge rather depressing, I do like the concept behind this one.</td>', 'I love the grainy effect here.  the slightly off center subject and the great expression also help. Although I am finding all these bleak shots in the challenge rather depressing, I do like the concept behind this one.', '2007-11-16 15:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252164, 611764, 20168, '<td valign="top">excellent duotone choice and peaceful in simplicity and classic design...one can almost hear the gregorian chant!</td>', 'excellent duotone choice and peaceful in simplicity and classic design...one can almost hear the gregorian chant!', '2007-11-16 15:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252165, 611731, 81382, '<td valign="top">Looks like you have really gone to town on the post processing and I''m not sure it works. The sky is great, the building just looks a little overdone, the entrance is nice but the tower on the right hand side lets it down</td>', 'Looks like you have really gone to town on the post processing and I''m not sure it works. The sky is great, the building just looks a little overdone, the entrance is nice but the tower on the right hand side lets it down', '2007-11-16 15:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252167, 611475, 23002, '<td valign="top">Yay!  A non-depressing image in this challenge!  Great detail in the feathers, and the reflection is awesome.  a bit too much of the OOF part in the top left perhaps, but overall a great shot.  8<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-11-19 00:21:20.</i></td>', 'Yay!  A non-depressing image in this challenge!  Great detail in the feathers, and the reflection is awesome.  a bit too much of the OOF part in the top left perhaps, but overall a great shot.  8', '2007-11-16 15:05:45.000000', '2007-11-19 00:21:20.000000', 1),
(4252168, 611028, 23002, '<td valign="top">awe...she''s cute!  I would like to see more contrast though.</td>', 'awe...she''s cute!  I would like to see more contrast though.', '2007-11-16 15:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252169, 611434, 81382, '<td valign="top">Great contrast on the star on the plane, having a completely black background is good but a little artifical. It could do with just a little bit of something just to break it up and bring the image back into reality</td>', 'Great contrast on the star on the plane, having a completely black background is good but a little artifical. It could do with just a little bit of something just to break it up and bring the image back into reality', '2007-11-16 15:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252170, 611638, 23002, '<td valign="top">A very interesting take on this challenge.  well done.</td>', 'A very interesting take on this challenge.  well done.', '2007-11-16 15:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252171, 611595, 23002, '<td valign="top">too underexposed, no contrast, no subject. :(</td>', 'too underexposed, no contrast, no subject. :(', '2007-11-16 15:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252174, 611547, 23002, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot, but I would love to have seen it with the DOF being totally from front to back in focus.  the edge of the glasses are very distracting the way it is now.</td>', 'An interesting shot, but I would love to have seen it with the DOF being totally from front to back in focus.  the edge of the glasses are very distracting the way it is now.', '2007-11-16 15:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252179, 610587, 811, '<td valign="top">Interesting color of sky</td>', 'Interesting color of sky', '2007-11-16 15:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252181, 611089, 811, '<td valign="top">This feels slightly unbalanced to me.  Maybe a tighter crop on the left.  Also, it seems a bit flat -- probably because the background has nothing to contrast it with.</td>', 'This feels slightly unbalanced to me.  Maybe a tighter crop on the left.  Also, it seems a bit flat -- probably because the background has nothing to contrast it with.', '2007-11-16 15:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252183, 611539, 811, '<td valign="top">Good capture.  I like the smoke (or whatever) in the upper right</td>', 'Good capture.  I like the smoke (or whatever) in the upper right', '2007-11-16 15:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252186, 611389, 811, '<td valign="top">Great color tones.  The obstruction on the right is distracting to me.  Perhaps if it were cropped so that detail wasn''t peeking through, it would serve as a frame instead.</td>', 'Great color tones.  The obstruction on the right is distracting to me.  Perhaps if it were cropped so that detail wasn''t peeking through, it would serve as a frame instead.', '2007-11-16 15:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252187, 612246, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the strong graphic feeling of this shot</td>', 'I like the strong graphic feeling of this shot', '2007-11-16 15:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252189, 609869, 46832, '<td valign="top">Didn''t quite make to a sepia print.  Too many other colors.  Not a duotone.</td>', 'Didn''t quite make to a sepia print.  Too many other colors.  Not a duotone.', '2007-11-16 15:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252193, 610894, 811, '<td valign="top">Very edgy feeling</td>', 'Very edgy feeling', '2007-11-16 15:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4252195, 611501, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the stillness in the foreground, but it feels  a bit "chopped" at the top.</td>', 'I like the stillness in the foreground, but it feels  a bit "chopped" at the top.', '2007-11-16 15:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
