(4253157, 610405, 58272, '<td valign="top">With a contrast bump this would really pop. There seems to a be a bit of a halo around your subject too.</td>', 'With a contrast bump this would really pop. There seems to a be a bit of a halo around your subject too.', '2007-11-16 22:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
