(4253184, 611757, 39850, '<td valign="top">Good potential, a variation in composition and ''bolder'' tones, may have made this much stronger, in my opinion.</td>', 'Good potential, a variation in composition and ''bolder'' tones, may have made this much stronger, in my opinion.', '2007-11-16 23:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253185, 611088, 33379, '<td valign="top">good tone for this scenery.</td>', 'good tone for this scenery.', '2007-11-16 23:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253187, 609350, 33379, '<td valign="top">I think your idea was good, it just wasn''t executed very well.</td>', 'I think your idea was good, it just wasn''t executed very well.', '2007-11-16 23:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253188, 611693, 33379, '<td valign="top">love it.  great tones.</td>', 'love it.  great tones.', '2007-11-16 23:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253189, 609675, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice image.  Like your composition.  Difficult, but the lighthouse either softer or sharper - just seems to be ''in between'', if that makes sense.</td>', '7 - Nice image.  Like your composition.  Difficult, but the lighthouse either softer or sharper - just seems to be ''in between'', if that makes sense.', '2007-11-16 23:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253191, 611470, 33379, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the litter bin is good.  but the guy just looks like a statue or like he''s disturbed.  his hands are weird. 6</td>', 'I like the idea and the litter bin is good.  but the guy just looks like a statue or like he''s disturbed.  his hands are weird. 6', '2007-11-16 23:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253194, 611746, 39850, '<td valign="top">Good potential.  Looks like this is very grainy (and apologies if that is intentional), so you may have resizing/pp issues.  This bigger (640), if the quality was there would be better.  The tones are nice in this image but, I wonder about a variation for added effect, especially in this Challenge.</td>', 'Good potential.  Looks like this is very grainy (and apologies if that is intentional), so you may have resizing/pp issues.  This bigger (640), if the quality was there would be better.  The tones are nice in this image but, I wonder about a variation for added effect, especially in this Challenge.', '2007-11-16 23:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253195, 611770, 33379, '<td valign="top">i wasnt going to comment on this one but here it is again.  when i first saw this in the thumbs it looked like the baby was in a bag.  i dont like the idea of a baby wrapped up like this.  creeps me out.  i''m not voting on it.</td>', 'i wasnt going to comment on this one but here it is again.  when i first saw this in the thumbs it looked like the baby was in a bag.  i dont like the idea of a baby wrapped up like this.  creeps me out.  i''m not voting on it.', '2007-11-16 23:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253197, 611333, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice image.  Like the composition.  Difficult, but my eye is looking for some balance at the top with the black, so perhaps the anthers, and that area, a bit darker - but unless you did that manually in pp, an overall contrast adjustment looks like it would blow that petal out.  Like your tone choice.</td>', '7 - Nice image.  Like the composition.  Difficult, but my eye is looking for some balance at the top with the black, so perhaps the anthers, and that area, a bit darker - but unless you did that manually in pp, an overall contrast adjustment looks like it would blow that petal out.  Like your tone choice.', '2007-11-16 23:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253198, 611465, 33379, '<td valign="top">Hey Fido!  is that a fence collar?  poor pup.  <br/>good image.</td>', 'Hey Fido!  is that a fence collar?  poor pup.  good image.', '2007-11-16 23:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
