(4253703, 611411, 65234, '<td valign="top">Tones are OK but I''m not sure what I think about the composition.  Not quite sure if you were going for an abstract of the lines and shapes or a reflection of the city.</td>', 'Tones are OK but I''m not sure what I think about the composition.  Not quite sure if you were going for an abstract of the lines and shapes or a reflection of the city.', '2007-11-17 08:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253710, 612283, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice detail; looks like he''s wearing a furry cape.</td>', 'Nice detail; looks like he''s wearing a furry cape.', '2007-11-17 08:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253716, 611831, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the diagonal in the composition.  Lighting looks a little flat; I love a bright glow on grassheads.</td>', 'Like the diagonal in the composition.  Lighting looks a little flat; I love a bright glow on grassheads.', '2007-11-17 08:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253719, 609982, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice!  Love the lighting and early morning mist feel to this, and how alert the dog is.</td>', 'Nice!  Love the lighting and early morning mist feel to this, and how alert the dog is.', '2007-11-17 08:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253720, 611028, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail; like the angle of the head in the composition.</td>', 'Very nice detail; like the angle of the head in the composition.', '2007-11-17 08:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253721, 610871, 65234, '<td valign="top">OMG, that''s a scary scene.  Love the leading line on the roof pointing right at the tornado.  Assume you managed to get out of the way in time since you had this shot to enter!</td>', 'OMG, that''s a scary scene.  Love the leading line on the roof pointing right at the tornado.  Assume you managed to get out of the way in time since you had this shot to enter!', '2007-11-17 08:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253723, 612280, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks like a pretty place and the man is well-placed in the picture, adding some life to it.  Horizon is tilted, which feels off to me, and the image looks like it might be oversharpened.</td>', 'Looks like a pretty place and the man is well-placed in the picture, adding some life to it.  Horizon is tilted, which feels off to me, and the image looks like it might be oversharpened.', '2007-11-17 08:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253727, 611341, 65234, '<td valign="top">Where do people find these incredibly cool skies?  Mine never looks that interesting!  Nice tones.  It looks a bit like a burn tool followed the cloud through the steeple, which makes the steeple blend into said cloud a little too much.</td>', 'Where do people find these incredibly cool skies?  Mine never looks that interesting!  Nice tones.  It looks a bit like a burn tool followed the cloud through the steeple, which makes the steeple blend into said cloud a little too much.', '2007-11-17 08:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253728, 610529, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting.</td>', 'Wonderful lighting.', '2007-11-17 08:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253733, 611704, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and good tonal range.  I''m seeing a few jaggies along the straight edges; you might try softening slightly along those lines after your final resizing to minimize those.</td>', 'Nicely composed and good tonal range.  I''m seeing a few jaggies along the straight edges; you might try softening slightly along those lines after your final resizing to minimize those.', '2007-11-17 08:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253736, 610635, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the lines and lighting in the composition.  Would like a little sharper focus on the central flower.</td>', 'Like the lines and lighting in the composition.  Would like a little sharper focus on the central flower.', '2007-11-17 08:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253738, 611753, 30982, '<td valign="top">Got the iPod going, I''d guess.  Great catch.</td>', 'Got the iPod going, I''d guess.  Great catch.', '2007-11-17 08:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253741, 611506, 30982, '<td valign="top">Too cute!!</td>', 'Too cute!!', '2007-11-17 08:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253745, 611577, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!!  Wonderful!  Perfect title, too.</td>', 'LOL!!  Wonderful!  Perfect title, too.', '2007-11-17 08:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253747, 611755, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice stopped motion :-)  Looks like a misty morning flight.  Crop feels a little off to me but I''m not sure why because you''ve got some nice diagonals going.  Maybe it''s just because he''s close to but not exactly centered.  Anyway, nice overall peaceful mood to this.</td>', 'Nice stopped motion :-)  Looks like a misty morning flight.  Crop feels a little off to me but I''m not sure why because you''ve got some nice diagonals going.  Maybe it''s just because he''s close to but not exactly centered.  Anyway, nice overall peaceful mood to this.', '2007-11-17 08:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253749, 611022, 59276, '<td valign="top">I love how you framed it.......the grain makes it look old.</td>', 'I love how you framed it.......the grain makes it look old.', '2007-11-17 09:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253751, 611727, 65234, '<td valign="top">Dramatic leading lines.  I like the gesturing with the handbag dangling, conveying an animated conversation on her part, and the closed-up body language of the listener.  This is one of those shots that gets better the longer I look at it.</td>', 'Dramatic leading lines.  I like the gesturing with the handbag dangling, conveying an animated conversation on her part, and the closed-up body language of the listener.  This is one of those shots that gets better the longer I look at it.', '2007-11-17 09:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253752, 611757, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail on the kitty and nice DOF.  Feels just a little cramped on top.</td>', 'Very nice detail on the kitty and nice DOF.  Feels just a little cramped on top.', '2007-11-17 09:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253754, 611195, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice composition; stark, lonely feel to the shot.</td>', 'Nice composition; stark, lonely feel to the shot.', '2007-11-17 09:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253755, 611509, 30982, '<td valign="top">Gentle and nicely detailed.  Toning suits it well - very evocative of fall and the end of the growing season.</td>', 'Gentle and nicely detailed.  Toning suits it well - very evocative of fall and the end of the growing season.', '2007-11-17 09:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253759, 610929, 65234, '<td valign="top">Composition has some nice lines.  Lighting is quite harsh so highlights are blown; I might make balance that by burning the darker areas to emphasize the texture and make that center bit seem to pop out more.</td>', 'Composition has some nice lines.  Lighting is quite harsh so highlights are blown; I might make balance that by burning the darker areas to emphasize the texture and make that center bit seem to pop out more.', '2007-11-17 09:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253763, 611505, 65234, '<td valign="top">Awww, little chickies :-)))  I like the lighting and detail/DOF.  Would love to have seen catchlights in their little eyes (they look somewhat 2-dimensional without them).</td>', 'Awww, little chickies :-)))  I like the lighting and detail/DOF.  Would love to have seen catchlights in their little eyes (they look somewhat 2-dimensional without them).', '2007-11-17 09:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253768, 610930, 65234, '<td valign="top">It does look like a tranquil place, and very private.  Softness works with the mood of the picture.  Image seems tilted; I think that''s an optical illusion due to the wide angle (top of the wall is not parallel to the water as my eye travels to the right).</td>', 'It does look like a tranquil place, and very private.  Softness works with the mood of the picture.  Image seems tilted; I think that''s an optical illusion due to the wide angle (top of the wall is not parallel to the water as my eye travels to the right).', '2007-11-17 09:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253769, 610745, 65234, '<td valign="top">What a lovely scene!  Beautifully composed, too.  I love the detail in the temple and the misty background.</td>', 'What a lovely scene!  Beautifully composed, too.  I love the detail in the temple and the misty background.', '2007-11-17 09:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253770, 609675, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice leading lines and dramatic sky.</td>', 'Nice leading lines and dramatic sky.', '2007-11-17 09:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253771, 610765, 65234, '<td valign="top">This nicely conveys cold and wet in a place that has seen generations of cold, wet people walk by.  Perspective and lines are very nice.</td>', 'This nicely conveys cold and wet in a place that has seen generations of cold, wet people walk by.  Perspective and lines are very nice.', '2007-11-17 09:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253772, 611748, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Looks like an animated conversation!</td>', 'LOL!  Looks like an animated conversation!', '2007-11-17 09:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253774, 611736, 65234, '<td valign="top">Blue gives this a nice, cool feeling, and the emptiness of the scene emphasizes that.  A little flat-looking; more contrast might help.</td>', 'Blue gives this a nice, cool feeling, and the emptiness of the scene emphasizes that.  A little flat-looking; more contrast might help.', '2007-11-17 09:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253778, 610205, 30982, '<td valign="top">From the train, I''m guessing?</td>', 'From the train, I''m guessing?', '2007-11-17 09:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253779, 610926, 65234, '<td valign="top">That is one odd-looking tree.  Very dramatic clouds.  The rest of the landscape is kind of dull; maybe getting closer to the subject tree and shooting at more of an upward angle with respect to the tree would make this a little more interesting.</td>', 'That is one odd-looking tree.  Very dramatic clouds.  The rest of the landscape is kind of dull; maybe getting closer to the subject tree and shooting at more of an upward angle with respect to the tree would make this a little more interesting.', '2007-11-17 09:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253781, 609783, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great tones and sharpness.  The sky looks stormy but the water doesn''t, and the light on the beach make it look like the heavens are about to part and something supernatural occur.</td>', 'Great tones and sharpness.  The sky looks stormy but the water doesn''t, and the light on the beach make it look like the heavens are about to part and something supernatural occur.', '2007-11-17 09:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253786, 609838, 33446, '<td valign="top">The collies back leg throws the picture off.</td>', 'The collies back leg throws the picture off.', '2007-11-17 09:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253787, 611088, 33446, '<td valign="top">I don''t know where to look....but I am more interested in the bottles on the shelves!</td>', 'I don''t know where to look....but I am more interested in the bottles on the shelves!', '2007-11-17 09:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253788, 611406, 65234, '<td valign="top">Terrific fantasy feel to this and the blue is a great choice to emphasize that.</td>', 'Terrific fantasy feel to this and the blue is a great choice to emphasize that.', '2007-11-17 09:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253789, 611506, 33446, '<td valign="top">You captured the nitty gritty in this photograph.<br/> <br/>And...apparently...the attention of the animal!!!</td>', 'You captured the nitty gritty in this photograph. And...apparently...the attention of the animal!!!', '2007-11-17 09:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253792, 611752, 67152, '<td valign="top">Back for a bump - excellent theme and composition</td>', 'Back for a bump - excellent theme and composition', '2007-11-17 09:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253794, 611460, 33446, '<td valign="top">I love the lines on the subjects.</td>', 'I love the lines on the subjects.', '2007-11-17 09:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253821, 610934, 11854, '<td valign="top">Love the dark, gothic feel of the processing.</td>', 'Love the dark, gothic feel of the processing.', '2007-11-17 10:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253824, 611795, 11854, '<td valign="top">I love these types of pictures, it has an almost surreal feel to. Great job!</td>', 'I love these types of pictures, it has an almost surreal feel to. Great job!', '2007-11-17 10:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253825, 610405, 11854, '<td valign="top">awwww, what a sweetie pie! I love the way children don''t give up when they really want to do something. Excellent processing.</td>', 'awwww, what a sweetie pie! I love the way children don''t give up when they really want to do something. Excellent processing.', '2007-11-17 10:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253827, 612234, 11854, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. Great choose of colors, the reddish brown hue really adds a rustic feel to the image.</td>', 'Very pretty. Great choose of colors, the reddish brown hue really adds a rustic feel to the image.', '2007-11-17 10:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253828, 611524, 11854, '<td valign="top">Bridesmaids? This does have a yesteryear feel to it. The bare feet with the peeling fence add quite a bit here.</td>', 'Bridesmaids? This does have a yesteryear feel to it. The bare feet with the peeling fence add quite a bit here.', '2007-11-17 10:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253830, 610765, 11854, '<td valign="top">Somber. First word that comes to mind. They look like they''re leaving a funeral. Nicely done.</td>', 'Somber. First word that comes to mind. They look like they''re leaving a funeral. Nicely done.', '2007-11-17 10:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253834, 611619, 11854, '<td valign="top">Very gothic feel to this. It almost seems like the people are gathering to storm the castle (ok, so I have a vivid imagination, lol). Nicely done!</td>', 'Very gothic feel to this. It almost seems like the people are gathering to storm the castle (ok, so I have a vivid imagination, lol). Nicely done!', '2007-11-17 10:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253836, 612280, 11854, '<td valign="top">That rockface is pretty intimidating! Love the whiteness of that line being sprayed. Excellent processing.</td>', 'That rockface is pretty intimidating! Love the whiteness of that line being sprayed. Excellent processing.', '2007-11-17 10:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253839, 611742, 11854, '<td valign="top">Very imaginative! Excellent processing. Texture added?</td>', 'Very imaginative! Excellent processing. Texture added?', '2007-11-17 10:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253840, 609377, 81382, '<td valign="top">Great duotone hue, nice and sharp, lovely colour gradients in the sky</td>', 'Great duotone hue, nice and sharp, lovely colour gradients in the sky', '2007-11-17 10:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253841, 611455, 11854, '<td valign="top">Incredible eyes! Spellbinding!</td>', 'Incredible eyes! Spellbinding!', '2007-11-17 10:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253842, 611689, 81382, '<td valign="top">Well composed, almost on the verge of being overexposed but the eyes are wonderfully sharp</td>', 'Well composed, almost on the verge of being overexposed but the eyes are wonderfully sharp', '2007-11-17 10:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253844, 609350, 81382, '<td valign="top">If only all the text was in focus since the centre of the record (as a whole) is the main focal point, its seems a little strange to only have the front of it sharp</td>', 'If only all the text was in focus since the centre of the record (as a whole) is the main focal point, its seems a little strange to only have the front of it sharp', '2007-11-17 10:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253845, 610761, 81382, '<td valign="top">Nice abstrast shot, could have pushed the deep tones a little harder to give move contrast to make a more dramatic image</td>', 'Nice abstrast shot, could have pushed the deep tones a little harder to give move contrast to make a more dramatic image', '2007-11-17 10:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253846, 609809, 81382, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field obviously. The black border is a little harsh, rather than absolute black it might have been good to eye dropper the darker colour on the rim of the cup. The border would then be a lot more in keeping with the rest of the image</td>', 'Great depth of field obviously. The black border is a little harsh, rather than absolute black it might have been good to eye dropper the darker colour on the rim of the cup. The border would then be a lot more in keeping with the rest of the image', '2007-11-17 10:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253847, 610919, 81382, '<td valign="top">Composition wise, the balance is all to the left, a bit more empty space on the rigt hand side, especially as the truck is facing that way might even things up a little</td>', 'Composition wise, the balance is all to the left, a bit more empty space on the rigt hand side, especially as the truck is facing that way might even things up a little', '2007-11-17 10:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253848, 610926, 81382, '<td valign="top">Excellent colours in the sky, it a shame though that your silhouette isn''t pin sharp.</td>', 'Excellent colours in the sky, it a shame though that your silhouette isn''t pin sharp.', '2007-11-17 10:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253849, 610641, 81382, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect. The sky has a very odd texture but I quite like it. The eyes looking at the child is a nice touch</td>', 'Interesting effect. The sky has a very odd texture but I quite like it. The eyes looking at the child is a nice touch', '2007-11-17 10:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253852, 610877, 81382, '<td valign="top">Wicked flare, it really works here. Lovely deep, strong duetone hue</td>', 'Wicked flare, it really works here. Lovely deep, strong duetone hue', '2007-11-17 10:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253855, 610934, 81382, '<td valign="top">Really gritty image but it works here. The sky and light coming through is really good. A popular blueish duetone hue would not have worked here, it would be too cold so you did right with this selection</td>', 'Really gritty image but it works here. The sky and light coming through is really good. A popular blueish duetone hue would not have worked here, it would be too cold so you did right with this selection', '2007-11-17 10:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253858, 611739, 81382, '<td valign="top">Nice background blur. I can''t help but think the eyes could do with a little more work to get them sharper and really sparkle</td>', 'Nice background blur. I can''t help but think the eyes could do with a little more work to get them sharper and really sparkle', '2007-11-17 10:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253862, 611747, 81382, '<td valign="top">Having the camera at the same height level as the subject or from an extreme height or low point to give an unusual viewpoint would have been better for me.</td>', 'Having the camera at the same height level as the subject or from an extreme height or low point to give an unusual viewpoint would have been better for me.', '2007-11-17 10:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253864, 611755, 81382, '<td valign="top">The background is quite noisy and bright. If it was a lot darker and more blurred then the main subject would stand out a lot more. The bird is also almost dead centre in the image and given you also have a "feature" in the water on the left hand side, the composition is is not that well balanced. Opening up more empty space on the right hand side during the cropping stage for the subject to fly into would have been better</td>', 'The background is quite noisy and bright. If it was a lot darker and more blurred then the main subject would stand out a lot more. The bird is also almost dead centre in the image and given you also have a "feature" in the water on the left hand side, the composition is is not that well balanced. Opening up more empty space on the right hand side during the cropping stage for the subject to fly into would have been better', '2007-11-17 10:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253879, 611460, 81382, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, great positions of the dancers, lovely tones and sharpness</td>', 'Excellent shot, great positions of the dancers, lovely tones and sharpness', '2007-11-17 10:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253881, 612269, 81382, '<td valign="top">Could have really pushed the levels hard to get it really gritty and dramatic to further enhance the subject. Lovely cropping. Some might say its too tight but I think it makes it quite abstract</td>', 'Could have really pushed the levels hard to get it really gritty and dramatic to further enhance the subject. Lovely cropping. Some might say its too tight but I think it makes it quite abstract', '2007-11-17 11:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253883, 611760, 81382, '<td valign="top">Its hard to pick out the detail here, the leaves at this resolution look like noise which is unfortunate.</td>', 'Its hard to pick out the detail here, the leaves at this resolution look like noise which is unfortunate.', '2007-11-17 11:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253892, 610550, 73747, '<td valign="top">Cool image, distracting title. Or am I missing something?</td>', 'Cool image, distracting title. Or am I missing something?', '2007-11-17 11:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253906, 611710, 73747, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! To be extremely picky, the only thing that might make this better is to not have cut the top of the clock tower off. 8</td>', 'Beautiful! To be extremely picky, the only thing that might make this better is to not have cut the top of the clock tower off. 8', '2007-11-17 11:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253914, 610359, 30982, '<td valign="top">What color are her eyes anyway?  I thought they were blue!  Ah, yes, duotone.  A very stylized, commercially viable portrait.  I think it''s time to open that studio.  I like how you got the high key thing and kept all the detail where you needed it.  And how did Rowan like eating the flower?  :-)  And I take it this was done with flash (large pupils means it was dark before the shot).  The lights are serving you very well.</td>', 'What color are her eyes anyway?  I thought they were blue!  Ah, yes, duotone.  A very stylized, commercially viable portrait.  I think it''s time to open that studio.  I like how you got the high key thing and kept all the detail where you needed it.  And how did Rowan like eating the flower?  :-)  And I take it this was done with flash (large pupils means it was dark before the shot).  The lights are serving you very well.', '2007-11-17 11:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253915, 612232, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice choice for this challenge.</td>', 'Very nice choice for this challenge.', '2007-11-17 11:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253916, 611557, 30982, '<td valign="top">Too funny!  Nicely done.</td>', 'Too funny!  Nicely done.', '2007-11-17 11:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253917, 609641, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice action work!</td>', 'Nice action work!', '2007-11-17 11:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253920, 611120, 73747, '<td valign="top">Cute but very dark.</td>', 'Cute but very dark.', '2007-11-17 11:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253927, 611694, 73747, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2007-11-17 11:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253933, 611825, 66201, '<td valign="top">The high contrast in this makes the image work - really weird effect. Love it.</td>', 'The high contrast in this makes the image work - really weird effect. Love it.', '2007-11-17 11:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253938, 611470, 66201, '<td valign="top">This image has so much going for it - I just find the hands very posed and his feet look tense...as if he is just about to get up or (again) posed. It has an interesting triptych effect: the man, the tree and the litter box.</td>', 'This image has so much going for it - I just find the hands very posed and his feet look tense...as if he is just about to get up or (again) posed. It has an interesting triptych effect: the man, the tree and the litter box.', '2007-11-17 11:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253939, 611619, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very grand and impressive.</td>', 'Very grand and impressive.', '2007-11-17 11:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253944, 611207, 66201, '<td valign="top">looks a bit oversharpened in some places. The squares lights in her eyes?  BUT other than that I love the whole composition and the fact that the sepia works so well for the subject ( the duotone has a purpose in this one).</td>', 'looks a bit oversharpened in some places. The squares lights in her eyes?  BUT other than that I love the whole composition and the fact that the sepia works so well for the subject ( the duotone has a purpose in this one).', '2007-11-17 11:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4253950, 611746, 66201, '<td valign="top">Really striking composition. I personally would have made this a bigger image on the page. So strange and intriguing.</td>', 'Really striking composition. I personally would have made this a bigger image on the page. So strange and intriguing.', '2007-11-17 11:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4254051, 611611, 11854, '<td valign="top">I''m not a great photographer, so take this comment for what it''s worth, lol. The image appears very flat with very little tonal range. The falls probably would have been a bit more dramatic if you could have gotten a bit closer and focused more of the play of the rocks with the water. As is, it''s just a bit to distant to really add much to the image.</td>', 'I''m not a great photographer, so take this comment for what it''s worth, lol. The image appears very flat with very little tonal range. The falls probably would have been a bit more dramatic if you could have gotten a bit closer and focused more of the play of the rocks with the water. As is, it''s just a bit to distant to really add much to the image.', '2007-11-17 12:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4254062, 611476, 11854, '<td valign="top">I''m not a great photographer, so take my comments for what they''re worth to you, lol.<br/>I''m assuming this is a tree, either dead or dying? It''s very dark and a bit out of focus. You''re probably getting hammered in voting because there is really not much to hold your attention.</td>', 'I''m not a great photographer, so take my comments for what they''re worth to you, lol.I''m assuming this is a tree, either dead or dying? It''s very dark and a bit out of focus. You''re probably getting hammered in voting because there is really not much to hold your attention.', '2007-11-17 12:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4254069, 611607, 11854, '<td valign="top">I''m not a great photographer, so take my comments for what they''re worth to you. While the toning is quite nice, there really isn''t much to interest the viewer in this shot. If you''re going to take pictures of the ordinary, you need to put some type of spin on it giving it a unique perspective.</td>', 'I''m not a great photographer, so take my comments for what they''re worth to you. While the toning is quite nice, there really isn''t much to interest the viewer in this shot. If you''re going to take pictures of the ordinary, you need to put some type of spin on it giving it a unique perspective.', '2007-11-17 12:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4254075, 612278, 11854, '<td valign="top">I''m not a great photographer, so take my comments for what they''re worth to you. While this light bulb would make an excellent abstract, the dead center position defeats the purpose. An off center or possibly square crop would work better. Also, I think it would looked better if you had used some color in your toning.</td>', 'I''m not a great photographer, so take my comments for what they''re worth to you. While this light bulb would make an excellent abstract, the dead center position defeats the purpose. An off center or possibly square crop would work better. Also, I think it would looked better if you had used some color in your toning.', '2007-11-17 12:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4254080, 609299, 11854, '<td valign="top">I''m not a great photographer, so take my comments for what they''re worth to you. Generally if you are going to shoot a statue, you need to put some type of unique spin on it. The straight on shot gives little viewer interest and the surrounding area of park detracts further.</td>', 'I''m not a great photographer, so take my comments for what they''re worth to you. Generally if you are going to shoot a statue, you need to put some type of unique spin on it. The straight on shot gives little viewer interest and the surrounding area of park detracts further.', '2007-11-17 13:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4254084, 611411, 11854, '<td valign="top">Nice toning overall. The one thing that throws me is the tilt of the main lines. It kind of makes me dizzy. lol</td>', 'Nice toning overall. The one thing that throws me is the tilt of the main lines. It kind of makes me dizzy. lol', '2007-11-17 13:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4254088, 611020, 11854, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model, lovely toning, excellent eyes. The only thing that hurts your image is the wrinkles in the background.</td>', 'Beautiful model, lovely toning, excellent eyes. The only thing that hurts your image is the wrinkles in the background.', '2007-11-17 13:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4254089, 611626, 11854, '<td valign="top">Nice dof, lovely toning.</td>', 'Nice dof, lovely toning.', '2007-11-17 13:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
