(4256041, 612234, 50695, '<td valign="top">the duotones create a compelling, bizarre, mysterious effect from what was probably a less interesting original. Well done.</td>', 'the duotones create a compelling, bizarre, mysterious effect from what was probably a less interesting original. Well done.', '2007-11-18 18:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
