(4256058, 611523, 50695, '<td valign="top">People so far away can have such impact. Even people who are gone can have such impact. You say that well here. 10 for your experimental little free verse poem.</td>', 'People so far away can have such impact. Even people who are gone can have such impact. You say that well here. 10 for your experimental little free verse poem.', '2007-11-18 18:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
