(4256196, 610760, 35804, '<td valign="top">I''m so happy you''ve left that single power line in. Most would have the urge to clone it right out...very nice.</td>', 'I''m so happy you''ve left that single power line in. Most would have the urge to clone it right out...very nice.', '2007-11-18 19:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
