(4257032, 611375, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m thinkin'' based on the comments folks didn''t see this as a duotone.  The trick, of course, is to make them THINK it''s a duotone whether it is or not.  And in digital processing, a duotone is an artificial contrivance anyway.</td>', 'I''m thinkin'' based on the comments folks didn''t see this as a duotone.  The trick, of course, is to make them THINK it''s a duotone whether it is or not.  And in digital processing, a duotone is an artificial contrivance anyway.', '2007-11-19 03:27:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4257034, 609401, 30982, '<td valign="top">For the record, I like the border.  One of my personal favorite kind of borders to add.  :-)  Good capture - I especially like the way his head is turned and I love the way the light is shining off the tips of the wings and tail.</td>', 'For the record, I like the border.  One of my personal favorite kind of borders to add.  :-)  Good capture - I especially like the way his head is turned and I love the way the light is shining off the tips of the wings and tail.', '2007-11-19 03:28:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4257038, 610760, 30982, '<td valign="top">I agree with RKT - do NOT clone out the power line or pole.  Those are elements essential to this, in my humble and oft misunderstood opinion.  Dark is good.  Dark works for this.</td>', 'I agree with RKT - do NOT clone out the power line or pole.  Those are elements essential to this, in my humble and oft misunderstood opinion.  Dark is good.  Dark works for this.', '2007-11-19 03:31:30.000000', NULL, 0),
