(4257053, 611814, 27482, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by doctornick:</b></div><hr/><i> This would look great in Colour!  Would you mind posting a colour version? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Trust me, it doesn´t so I won´t :)<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SoulMan1978:</b></div><hr/><i>terrifically lit and detailed, shame the make up hides her expression a bit :-(</i></td></tr></table> <br/>That was kind of the point with the makeup but thx for taking the time to comment.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-11-19 03:36:18.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by doctornick: This would look great in Colour!  Would you mind posting a colour version?  Trust me, it doesn´t so I won´t :) Originally posted by SoulMan1978:terrifically lit and detailed, shame the make up hides her expression a bit :-( That was kind of the point with the makeup but thx for taking the time to comment.', '2007-11-19 03:35:47.000000', '2007-11-19 03:36:18.000000', 0),
(4257057, 611610, 30982, '<td valign="top">OK, this just goes to show how out of touch I am with DPC.  I didn''t even notice the freakin'' light pole ''til you told me about it.  I really will work harder on my "find the technical/compositional flaws" skills.  I just really liked it, that''s all.  :-)</td>', 'OK, this just goes to show how out of touch I am with DPC.  I didn''t even notice the freakin'' light pole ''til you told me about it.  I really will work harder on my "find the technical/compositional flaws" skills.  I just really liked it, that''s all.  :-)', '2007-11-19 03:36:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4257083, 610155, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the toning - though I think it''s more creepy than spooky if that makes sense.  But what you should have shot is the dog tied to the tree.  :-)  (Your notes made me laugh!)</td>', 'I like the toning - though I think it''s more creepy than spooky if that makes sense.  But what you should have shot is the dog tied to the tree.  :-)  (Your notes made me laugh!)', '2007-11-19 03:45:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4257085, 610677, 30982, '<td valign="top">What makes this work for me is the warmth in his eyes.  At 1/30th of a second, it''s hard to get a sharp image, even with a tripod when you''re shooting people - the darn things breathe and move and stuff.  That said, I think you did a great job with this in post to get a very nice portrait!</td>', 'What makes this work for me is the warmth in his eyes.  At 1/30th of a second, it''s hard to get a sharp image, even with a tripod when you''re shooting people - the darn things breathe and move and stuff.  That said, I think you did a great job with this in post to get a very nice portrait!', '2007-11-19 03:47:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4257088, 611485, 48228, '<td valign="top">Well done <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=67145" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">roz</a> and what a score you received for this fine image..... You are on a roll dear friend..... I just love the colors of this one.....<br/>This just <b>HAS</b> to be your xmas card.....<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-11-19 03:50:34.</i></td>', 'Well done  roz and what a score you received for this fine image..... You are on a roll dear friend..... I just love the colors of this one.....This just HAS to be your xmas card.....', '2007-11-19 03:48:07.000000', '2007-11-19 03:50:34.000000', 0),
