(4257166, 611474, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m not always a huge fan of waterfalls (no odd childhood incidents, just don''t think they photograph well - they''re much nicer in ''real life'') but the house in this one makes it far more interesting than your average waterfall shot.</td>', 'I''m not always a huge fan of waterfalls (no odd childhood incidents, just don''t think they photograph well - they''re much nicer in ''real life'') but the house in this one makes it far more interesting than your average waterfall shot.', '2007-11-19 04:46:39.000000', NULL, 0),
