(4257180, 612284, 30982, '<td valign="top">Has a moody somewhat depressed feel to it.  Some days I like graffiti, other days not so much, particularly if it is not well done.  If there''s a way to move back and get a bit more expansiveness to this, I think it would add to the depressed feel that your toning gives it.</td>', 'Has a moody somewhat depressed feel to it.  Some days I like graffiti, other days not so much, particularly if it is not well done.  If there''s a way to move back and get a bit more expansiveness to this, I think it would add to the depressed feel that your toning gives it.', '2007-11-19 04:57:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4257181, 611565, 30982, '<td valign="top">I very much like this.  The composition is perfect in my opinion, and as I said, very much shows the joy and wonder of a new mother.  I think this would also be lovely in straight black and white.  Hopefully you can get a copy to her!</td>', 'I very much like this.  The composition is perfect in my opinion, and as I said, very much shows the joy and wonder of a new mother.  I think this would also be lovely in straight black and white.  Hopefully you can get a copy to her!', '2007-11-19 04:59:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4257187, 611573, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh - looks more like a dog than a duck!  Looks like a very good dog, though - sweet face.  Next time you shoot him (her?), see if you can get more of a front shot so we can see the face more.  The composition here seems to focus a bit on just the ear.  The black and white conversion is good - you''ve got good detail in both the darks and the lights, which is hard to do with what I suspect is a black and white dog.</td>', 'Heh - looks more like a dog than a duck!  Looks like a very good dog, though - sweet face.  Next time you shoot him (her?), see if you can get more of a front shot so we can see the face more.  The composition here seems to focus a bit on just the ear.  The black and white conversion is good - you''ve got good detail in both the darks and the lights, which is hard to do with what I suspect is a black and white dog.', '2007-11-19 05:03:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4257192, 610923, 66353, '<td valign="top">Great score and great shot - well done Deb :)</td>', 'Great score and great shot - well done Deb :)', '2007-11-19 05:05:43.000000', NULL, 0),
