(4257541, 609401, 66597, '<td valign="top">Julianne, I really like the perspective and capture of facial expression. Unfortunately, it''s just a touch soft. Does your camera have a sports mode? I often use it to photograph birds in flight and find it works well for motion. The downside on the Canon model, at least, is that the sports mode only works in JPEG (no RAW).</td>', 'Julianne, I really like the perspective and capture of facial expression. Unfortunately, it''s just a touch soft. Does your camera have a sports mode? I often use it to photograph birds in flight and find it works well for motion. The downside on the Canon model, at least, is that the sports mode only works in JPEG (no RAW).', '2007-11-19 09:14:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4257542, 610917, 67152, '<td valign="top">Jon<br/> <br/>I love the comments and commentary that you provide with your photos.  Excellent stuff!<br/> <br/>I think the processing and contrasts of the darkness of the buildings and the sky work extremely well in this image.  <br/> <br/>However, the cropping of the boats in front really don''t seem to fit the image for some strange reason.  The way they are cropped (especially the sailboat in the foreground and how we only see a bit of the hull) and the fact that one is a very modern boat gives me a feeling that this is a quick snap.  <br/> <br/>A much closer-in shot with more height and less straight on set up would likely really help.  The names and the details in these old warehouses are very cool - leveraging those attributes - would help this score better.</td>', 'Jon I love the comments and commentary that you provide with your photos.  Excellent stuff! I think the processing and contrasts of the darkness of the buildings and the sky work extremely well in this image.   However, the cropping of the boats in front really don''t seem to fit the image for some strange reason.  The way they are cropped (especially the sailboat in the foreground and how we only see a bit of the hull) and the fact that one is a very modern boat gives me a feeling that this is a quick snap.   A much closer-in shot with more height and less straight on set up would likely really help.  The names and the details in these old warehouses are very cool - leveraging those attributes - would help this score better.', '2007-11-19 09:14:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4257543, 609350, 3724, '<td valign="top">45 format still life. Appears thoughtfully framed, carefully composed, nostalgic arrangement, sentimental, however, an interesting ordinary subject &amp; light is good on this centered DOT.</td>', '45 format still life. Appears thoughtfully framed, carefully composed, nostalgic arrangement, sentimental, however, an interesting ordinary subject & light is good on this centered DOT.', '2007-11-19 09:15:17.000000', NULL, 0),
