(4257551, 611565, 66597, '<td valign="top">This seems really underrated to me. I''m having trouble figuring out why this didn''t score higher - maybe not quite enough contrast on the faces (a bit of dodging / burning or soft light layering might have brought them out a little more). Still, the interaction between the mother and child is lovely, and the DOF is perfect. I think you got robbed!</td>', 'This seems really underrated to me. I''m having trouble figuring out why this didn''t score higher - maybe not quite enough contrast on the faces (a bit of dodging / burning or soft light layering might have brought them out a little more). Still, the interaction between the mother and child is lovely, and the DOF is perfect. I think you got robbed!', '2007-11-19 09:17:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4257552, 611556, 66597, '<td valign="top">I really like this, shadow and all. In fact, this is one of the few instances where I think a shadow really adds to a portrait. Highly underrated IMO.</td>', 'I really like this, shadow and all. In fact, this is one of the few instances where I think a shadow really adds to a portrait. Highly underrated IMO.', '2007-11-19 09:18:22.000000', NULL, 0),
