(4257604, 610917, 35545, '<td valign="top">I was so taken by the Albert Warehouse and the sky that I didn''t notice the crop of the boats in front, and even when reminded, the boats don''t bother me.  These are docks!  I love the processing.  I have the impression that that this was a dark, cold day, and I want to get inside those cozy apartments.</td>', 'I was so taken by the Albert Warehouse and the sky that I didn''t notice the crop of the boats in front, and even when reminded, the boats don''t bother me.  These are docks!  I love the processing.  I have the impression that that this was a dark, cold day, and I want to get inside those cozy apartments.', '2007-11-19 09:37:50.000000', NULL, 0),
