(4257610, 610543, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is so cool. I can''t find anything to suggest or criticize. I think you got a fairly good placement in this challenge, but I am really surprised the score didn''t even make it to 6.</td>', 'This is so cool. I can''t find anything to suggest or criticize. I think you got a fairly good placement in this challenge, but I am really surprised the score didn''t even make it to 6.', '2007-11-19 09:44:16.000000', NULL, 0),
