(4257621, 611565, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is a nice composition, a beautiful baby, a loving expression on the mother, and very nice duotone. Unfortunately I find the bra strap distracting and a bit of a turnoff. I wish you could have gotten the shot without the bra (with just the baby covering the breast, or with the blanket draped up on the mother''s shoulder.</td>', 'This is a nice composition, a beautiful baby, a loving expression on the mother, and very nice duotone. Unfortunately I find the bra strap distracting and a bit of a turnoff. I wish you could have gotten the shot without the bra (with just the baby covering the breast, or with the blanket draped up on the mother''s shoulder.', '2007-11-19 09:57:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4257625, 609982, 68514, '<td valign="top">Very good image Alex. Nice tones and composition. Ciao.</td>', 'Very good image Alex. Nice tones and composition. Ciao.', '2007-11-19 09:59:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4257634, 611565, 52992, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely stunning.<br/> <br/>And, while others find the bra strap distracting - I like it.  It''s a nursing bra, which tells me she''s nursing her child.</td>', 'This is absolutely stunning. And, while others find the bra strap distracting - I like it.  It''s a nursing bra, which tells me she''s nursing her child.', '2007-11-19 10:04:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4257649, 611825, 35804, '<td valign="top">Definitely not a DPC type shot but who gives a rip....that''s what makes it fabulous. I just love how "spastic" it is...ah the energy of youth. One of my handful of 10s. Awesome work M.</td>', 'Definitely not a DPC type shot but who gives a rip....that''s what makes it fabulous. I just love how "spastic" it is...ah the energy of youth. One of my handful of 10s. Awesome work M.', '2007-11-19 10:11:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4257662, 611753, 37961, '<td valign="top">Unique. Very visually interesting.</td>', 'Unique. Very visually interesting.', '2007-11-19 10:15:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4257673, 610315, 67697, '<td valign="top">Another one of your great building shots!  You did a magnificent job of catching the lighting in all the right places.  I love that the drum is highlighted as well.  Great job and I am glad to see your camera is working!  :)</td>', 'Another one of your great building shots!  You did a magnificent job of catching the lighting in all the right places.  I love that the drum is highlighted as well.  Great job and I am glad to see your camera is working!  :)', '2007-11-19 10:22:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4257677, 611704, 67697, '<td valign="top">I think this should have scored higher - but what do I know?  Love the perspective, the light, and of course the blue color tone.  :)</td>', 'I think this should have scored higher - but what do I know?  Love the perspective, the light, and of course the blue color tone.  :)', '2007-11-19 10:23:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4257686, 610923, 67697, '<td valign="top">Deb, your work with capturing portraits continues to get more powerful.  The colortone is perfect for this and her eyes are amazing.  Such a beautiful shot.  It''s very mesmerizing.</td>', 'Deb, your work with capturing portraits continues to get more powerful.  The colortone is perfect for this and her eyes are amazing.  Such a beautiful shot.  It''s very mesmerizing.', '2007-11-19 10:25:36.000000', NULL, 0),
