(4258905, 611455, 79720, '<td valign="top">I''m getting pretty good at this! <b>:</b>-)<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by david_c:</b></div><hr/><i> Captivating portrait. <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=14386" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">librodo</a>-worthy, if I may say so. 10. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'I''m getting pretty good at this! :-) Originally posted by david_c: Captivating portrait.  librodo-worthy, if I may say so. 10. ', '2007-11-19 19:35:44.000000', NULL, 0),
