(4260094, 610765, 68035, '<td valign="top">Peter, I love this photograph which almost has a feel of the late 70''s to it.  Moody and atmospheric and simply remarkable given the equipment you were using.  Love the lustrous sepia tones</td>', 'Peter, I love this photograph which almost has a feel of the late 70''s to it.  Moody and atmospheric and simply remarkable given the equipment you were using.  Love the lustrous sepia tones', '2007-11-20 09:49:16.000000', NULL, 0),
