(4261473, 610917, 24454, '<td valign="top">I think it would be so awesome to live in one of those restored apartments.   I agree. . .there''s nothing special about something old if it gets dilappidated and creates a run down look.   It looks like they are doing a great job of maintaining the character and rich old look of the place.<br/> <br/>I think this such a great photo to do in duotones.  You did so good!  I would love to visit there some day!<br/> <br/></td>', 'I think it would be so awesome to live in one of those restored apartments.   I agree. . .there''s nothing special about something old if it gets dilappidated and creates a run down look.   It looks like they are doing a great job of maintaining the character and rich old look of the place. I think this such a great photo to do in duotones.  You did so good!  I would love to visit there some day! ', '2007-11-20 22:11:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4261678, 611063, 29011, '<td valign="top">A gently capture. Gotta love the gentle highlights and the low key look. I like the line of light going across the bottom and the black background is a nice finishing touch.</td>', 'A gently capture. Gotta love the gentle highlights and the low key look. I like the line of light going across the bottom and the black background is a nice finishing touch.', '2007-11-20 23:52:59.000000', NULL, 0),
