(4261894, 609982, 41337, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by AlexSaberi:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Ben:</b></div><hr/><i> Incredible.<br/>Such delicate qualities caught here by the early morning light backlighting them.<br/>Not convinced on the out of focus foreground however. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>The foreground is actually not oof and without it u lose the atmophere imo </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Exactly. Without it you have just a technically flawless photo with little substance.</td>', 'Originally posted by AlexSaberi: Originally posted by Ben: Incredible.Such delicate qualities caught here by the early morning light backlighting them.Not convinced on the out of focus foreground however.  The foreground is actually not oof and without it u lose the atmophere imo   Exactly. Without it you have just a technically flawless photo with little substance.', '2007-11-21 00:45:02.000000', NULL, 0),
