(4264002, 611734, 64446, '<td valign="top">This image is very effective by its simplicity and the nice contrasty lines and textures of the basket. The artichoke doesn''t have the same vibration (light and contrast are a bit flat on it) and maybe that''s the reason it didn''t score higher. I find it a very interesting composition. Very well done!</td>', 'This image is very effective by its simplicity and the nice contrasty lines and textures of the basket. The artichoke doesn''t have the same vibration (light and contrast are a bit flat on it) and maybe that''s the reason it didn''t score higher. I find it a very interesting composition. Very well done!', '2007-11-22 00:00:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4264699, 611205, 1031, '<td valign="top">I really lake the interplay of light and shadow, and the sense of action introduced by the gunsmoke. The very-sharp foreground and blurry background and the stark lighting almost make it look like a studio shot of a model/diorama -- an effect which works well for this image.</td>', 'I really lake the interplay of light and shadow, and the sense of action introduced by the gunsmoke. The very-sharp foreground and blurry background and the stark lighting almost make it look like a studio shot of a model/diorama -- an effect which works well for this image.', '2007-11-22 13:52:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4265387, 610325, 35452, '<td valign="top">wow, i like this a lot</td>', 'wow, i like this a lot', '2007-11-23 01:44:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4265411, 611205, 1031, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the notes -- that''s quite a bit of stuff. I think if you''re using a later version of Photoshop you can set it up to keep a log of all the editing steps in a text file, which you can then copy/paste/edit for your notes.<br/> <br/>It''s interesting that you did most of the editing after converting it to the duotone colors.</td>', 'Thanks for the notes -- that''s quite a bit of stuff. I think if you''re using a later version of Photoshop you can set it up to keep a log of all the editing steps in a text file, which you can then copy/paste/edit for your notes. It''s interesting that you did most of the editing after converting it to the duotone colors.', '2007-11-23 02:31:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4265831, 611475, 62249, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. Extremely well lit. I love the detailed "lines" in the large feather contrasted with the fuzzy--yet sharp--smaller feather. This would make a great screen saver (and of course fabulous print).<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-11-23 13:22:53.</i></td>', 'Gorgeous. Extremely well lit. I love the detailed "lines" in the large feather contrasted with the fuzzy--yet sharp--smaller feather. This would make a great screen saver (and of course fabulous print).', '2007-11-23 13:16:53.000000', '2007-11-23 13:22:53.000000', 0),
