(4271516, 611600, 40679, '<td valign="top">the blue tones seem to work allright here. <br/> <br/>her eye really gets the attention. nice detail in the hair!<br/> <br/>the only thing I think could use a bit improvement, is the expression and pose of the model. it misses some spark, and I can see her chin. maybe next time ask her to keep her chin up a little bit.</td>', 'the blue tones seem to work allright here.  her eye really gets the attention. nice detail in the hair! the only thing I think could use a bit improvement, is the expression and pose of the model. it misses some spark, and I can see her chin. maybe next time ask her to keep her chin up a little bit.', '2007-11-27 15:41:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4271521, 610760, 40679, '<td valign="top">I''d love to see this one bigger.. I think the details are fantastic. because of the darker part at the bottom of the photo, I want to soom in and check the details there.<br/> <br/>love the greenish / yellowish tones you used here. they really add to the atmosphere in the photo.<br/> <br/>nice job!</td>', 'I''d love to see this one bigger.. I think the details are fantastic. because of the darker part at the bottom of the photo, I want to soom in and check the details there. love the greenish / yellowish tones you used here. they really add to the atmosphere in the photo. nice job!', '2007-11-27 15:45:42.000000', NULL, 0),
