(4316678, 609377, 72670, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this shot! I am a sucker for lighthouses and you have done a kickass job with the composition, picking the right time for  lighting,and the processing.You are a master! I am surprised you didn''t ribbon. I give you a ribbon if thats any consolation.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-12-16 02:11:33.</i></td>', 'I absolutely love this shot! I am a sucker for lighthouses and you have done a kickass job with the composition, picking the right time for  lighting,and the processing.You are a master! I am surprised you didn''t ribbon. I give you a ribbon if thats any consolation.', '2007-12-16 02:05:52.000000', '2007-12-16 02:11:33.000000', 0),
